,"id":7462263,"login":"KevinKib","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjIyNjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/commits/337173e63cad5d3d5c4f2018bb87a1ba69efd1e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T17:33:59Z","email":"sekanor21@gmail.com","name":"Kévin Kib"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T17:33:59Z","email":"sekanor21@gmail.com","name":"Kévin Kib"},"message":"fix(deps): bump FrenchCards to 0.2.1 and adapt to breaking distribution API\n\nFrenchCards 0.2.1 reworked Deck distribution:\n- DistributionOptions now wraps a Visibility instead of a boolean\n  isIdenticalCardsNumberForced flag; the boolean constructor and\n  IDENTICAL_CARDS_NUMBER were removed.\n- distributeAll(nbPlayers, DistributionOptions) no longer throws\n  UnevenNumberOfCardsPerPlayerException (even-split moved to the new\n  distributeAllEvenly).\n\nBatailleCorse.initializePlayersAndHands used both removed pieces:\nnew DistributionOptions(false) and a now-unreachable catch on\nUnevenNumberOfCardsPerPlayerException. That call meant \"deal the whole\ndeck round-robin, uneven allowed\", which is exactly the no-arg-options\ndistributeAll(nbPlayers). Switched to it and dropped the dead try/catch.\nBehavior is unchanged: the deck is created HIDDEN and 0.2.1 distribution\nonly ever hides (never shows), so cards stay face down as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"654f86a7cffb03a5bbdcfe7126c289dbe5381f3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/git/trees/654f86a7cffb03a5bbdcfe7126c289dbe5381f3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/git/commits/337173e63cad5d3d5c4f2018bb87a1ba69efd1e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7462263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KevinKib","id":7462263,"login":"KevinKib","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjIyNjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/commit/337173e63cad5d3d5c4f2018bb87a1ba69efd1e2","node_id":"C_kwDOSCYiVtoAKDMzNzE3M2U2M2NhZDVkM2Q1YzRmMjAxOGJiODdhMWJhNjllZmQxZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/commit/4a4ed30f9146974bf40ffadead7cfd79f1a4770e","sha":"4a4ed30f9146974bf40ffadead7cfd79f1a4770e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/commits/4a4ed30f9146974bf40ffadead7cfd79f1a4770e"}],"sha":"337173e63cad5d3d5c4f2018bb87a1ba69efd1e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/commits/337173e63cad5d3d5c4f2018bb87a1ba69efd1e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7462263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/events{/privacy}","followers_url":