thub.com/users/KevinKib/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/commits/c6d756b844a309f467e067802c19fff65bbd9619/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T17:00:35Z","email":"sekanor21@gmail.com","name":"Kévin Kib"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T17:00:35Z","email":"sekanor21@gmail.com","name":"Kévin Kib"},"message":"fix(frontend): register Bullshit seat presence + reuse leave guard for forfeit\n\nThe disconnect/forfeit UI never fired because BullshitSession never registered\npresence: the backend attributes a socket drop to a seat only if the session was\nbound via /app/presence (PresenceService.onDisconnect no-ops otherwise). Only\nBatailleCorse''s GameSession sent it. Bullshit now calls setPresence({gameId,token})\non bind (re-asserted on reconnect by WebSocketService), so a tab close starts the\n60s grace timer and broadcasts OPPONENT_DISCONNECTED/RECONNECTED/FORFEIT.\n\nAdds an explicit leave path mirroring BatailleCorse exactly — reuses the shared\nuseLeaveGuard composable (navigate away -> confirm -> forfeit) and the same\nRouterLink Back button; BullshitSession.forfeit() publishes /app/forfeit, exposed\nas the store''s forfeit() action.\n\n184 frontend tests green; build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a4a62aff3aa99df15268a55a76ceb7c9f07a732","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/git/trees/8a4a62aff3aa99df15268a55a76ceb7c9f07a732"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/git/commits/c6d756b844a309f467e067802c19fff65bbd9619",