 the domain package.\n- startGame uses SessionGame.isHost + claimedCount instead of inline token/seat\n  comparison and a stream count.\n- createGame seat-init uses claimAllSeats() (solo) / claimHost() (multiplayer);\n  HOST_SEAT constant now lives on SessionGame, removing it from the service.\n- createRoom uses SessionGame.create(id, seatCount, gameType); rematch uses\n  seatCount(). LobbyDto reuses SessionGame.isHost/HOST_SEAT/claimedCount,\n  centralizing the host=seat-0 convention. New SessionGame-level tests.","tree":{"sha":"099caea00578b3dd5ec1e2957daee6c41b671ffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/git/trees/099caea00578b3dd5ec1e2957daee6c41b671ffc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/git/commits/dcf5ee470817b57686000a4bbfb0892db3f8d3f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7462263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KevinKib","id":7462263,"login":"KevinKib","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjIyNjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/commit/dcf5ee470817b57686000a4bbfb0892db3f8d3f8","node_id":"C_kwDOSCYiVtoAKGRjZjVlZTQ3MDgxN2I