lException), pushing the rule onto the object it''s a rule about and\ndropping the impossible-state token lookup. Name defaulting moves onto\nSessionPlayer.claim, centralizing ''Player N'' across all claim sites. The\nservice keeps only orchestration (already-started guard, load, delegate, map).","tree":{"sha":"402898b3eca564be8d264dea7c2086f86ac2efa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/git/trees/402898b3eca564be8d264dea7c2086f86ac2efa6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/git/commits/ed3239715913b4d362194a9a3ccc002284ec8d19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7462263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KevinKib","id":7462263,"login":"KevinKib","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NjIyNjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KevinKib","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/commit/ed3239715913b4d362194a9a3ccc002284ec8d19","node_id":"C_kwDOSCYiVtoAKGVkMzIzOTcxNTkxM2I0ZDM2MjE5NGE5YTNjY2MwMDIyODRlYzhkMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KevinKib/BatailleCorse/commit/c2e3abf205fe93f95018654c31e31df0128e5e3f","sha":"c2e3abf205fe93f95018654c31e31df0128e5e3f","url":"https://api.gi