6-04-17T19:34:59Z","email":"rscanesilva@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Scane"},"message":"fix(sdk): isolate SDK failures to prevent instability in consumer apps\n\n- node/nestjs: wrap report-building in try-catch so HTTP response is\n  always sent even if parseStackTrace/computeFingerprint throws\n- node/process: call process.exit(1) after uncaughtException with a\n  2s safety timeout to prevent zombie processes\n- vue: wrap errorHandler body in try-catch so SDK failure never\n  disrupts Vue''s error lifecycle\n- java: chain previous UncaughtExceptionHandler instead of replacing it\n\nBump all SDKs to 2.0.3.","tree":{"sha":"af67dbba52bd2e46f26add2f02c403b70ce34397","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Farm-Investimentos/ia-exception-handler/git/trees/af67dbba52bd2e46f26add2f02c403b70ce34397"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Farm-Investimentos/ia-exception-handler/git/commits/a8d7ab742d3b2129966414e12d43941b1f3cb9d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5248457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rscanesilva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rscanesilva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rscanesilva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rscanesilva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rscanesilva","id":5248457,"login":"rscanesilva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDg0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rscanesilva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rscanesilva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rscanesilva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rscanesilva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rscanesilva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rscanesilva","user_view_ty