_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T06:16:55Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"message":"feat: full frontend integration + backend fixes\n\nBackend:\n- main.py: PackageDetectionRequest Pydantic model for /evidence/{id}/package_detection\n  (was dict — now properly typed, handles Optional fields)\n\nFrontend:\n- api.js: add evidenceService (getSummary, getCustody, exportBundle, syncToGCS)\n          add streamService (start, stop, getResults, getActive)\n- SocketContext: add stream:detection to SWARM_EVENTS\n- DashboardContext:\n  - add liveStreams state for active stream monitoring\n  - sentinel:threat_found now captures audio_match, audio_confidence,\n    forensics_chain, forensics_first_platform, forensics_leak_risk\n  - stream:detection handler: updates liveStreams, fires threat toast\n  - expose liveStreams in context value\n- IncidentTable: forensics chain badges (sharing chain, leak source, audio match)\n  shown on incident cards when data available\n- ThreatHunter: stream:detection in LOG_CFG + logText\n\n.gitignore: exclude Backend/evidence_vault/ (runtime artifacts)","tree":{"sha":"f2c40e1dfef5c8bf9443e6ecb23e294a34372275","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/git/trees/f2c40e1dfef5c8bf9443e6ecb23e294a34372275"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/git/commits/997342dd73f1587c67c808ebf313a7d78932d02c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180258418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KaranGupta2005","id":18025841