ort@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"message":"feat: Evidence Vault + Chain-of-Custody + Live Stream pipeline\n\nevidence_vault.py (new):\n- Content-addressed storage (SHA-256 deduplication)\n- Immutable chain-of-custody: every detection/classification/DMCA/review\n  creates a chained custody event (prev_hash → current_hash)\n- Tamper detection: verify_custody_chain() recomputes every hash\n- Artifacts: thumbnail.jpg, clip_embedding.npy, sentinel_result.json,\n  audio_fingerprint.json, forensics_chain.json, dmca_notice.txt, contract.json\n- Dual storage: local ./evidence_vault/ + GCS (EVIDENCE_BUCKET env var)\n- Delta sync: skips re-upload if hash matches\n- Atomic writes: .tmp → os.replace() for crash safety\n- Export: ZIP bundle with all artifacts + manifest + custody log\n- Live stream segments: independent evidence packages per 30s segment\n\nlive_stream.py (new):\n- Parallel pipeline: Embed + Audio run concurrently per segment\n  (not sequential — designed for continuous ingestion)\n- StreamMonitor: extraction → embed+audio → scan → alert\n- Each 30s segment flows independently through all pipeline stages\n- Segment latency: detection in ~30s, not after full stream ends\n- StreamRegistry: tracks active monitors, results, stop/start\n- Segments packaged to evidence vault immediately (fire-and-forget)\n\nmain.py:\n- POST /evidence/{id}/package_detection — called by swarm (non-blocking)\n- GET/POST /evidence/{id} — summary, custody, export, sync\n- POST/DELETE/GET /stream/* — live stream monitoring endpoints\n\nserver/routes/stream.js + evidence.js (new):\n- Node.js proxy routes for live stream + evidence vault\n- stream.js polls FastAPI every 10s and emits Socket.IO events\n\nserver/app.js:\n- Register streamRouter + evidenceRouter\n\nserver/controllers/swarmController.js:\n- Auto-package detection evidence after each sentinel scan\n- Fire-and-forget: never blocks swarm pipeline on vault failure\n\nBackend/.env.example:\n- EVIDENCE_BUCKET: GCS bucket for art