s.txt:\n- scipy: required by forensics.py (DCT via scipy.fft.dctn) and\n  train_forensics.py (same). Was missing — would cause ImportError at runtime.\n- google-cloud-storage: required by train_forensics.py GCS upload and\n  forensics.py _load_model_weights() GCS fallback when gsutil unavailable.\n\nBackend/.env.example:\n- Documents all env vars including new forensics ones:\n  FORENSICS_MODEL_PATH, FORENSICS_MODEL_GCS, GCS_BUCKET\n- Clear instructions for each var","tree":{"sha":"c79268aaaf538ff0c5d4f9960ef85c40f8fa578d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/git/trees/c79268aaaf538ff0c5d4f9960ef85c40f8fa578d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/git/commits/6253b45303d3d3595efafe513d1d99baba6bbbcb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180258418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KaranGupta2005","id":180258418,"login":"KaranGupta2005","node_id":"U_kgDOCr6Gcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/commit/6253b45303d3d3595efafe513d1d99baba6bbbcb","node_id":"C_kwDOSCghgtoAKDYyNTNiNDUzMDNkM2QzNTk1ZWZhZmU1MTNkMWQ5OWJhYmE2YmJiY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/commit/14ccdd3b8c96a07b3e8a9973575ffa5f0af3b2a4","sha":"14ccdd3b8c96a07b3e8a9973575ffa5f0af3b2a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/commits/14ccdd3b8c96a07b3e8a9973575ffa5f0af3b2a4"}],"sha":"6253b45303d3d3595efafe513d1d99baba6bbbcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/commits/6253b45303d3d3595efafe513d1d99baba6bbbcb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180258418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KaranGupta2005","id":180258418,"login":"KaranGupta2005","node_id":"U_kgDOCr6Gcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/commits/14ccdd3b8c96a07b3e8a9973575ffa5f0af3b2a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T17:53:07Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T17:53:07Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"message":"feat: production training script for forensics model\n\ntrain_forensics.py:\n- Clean, self-contained training script (no Colab boilerplate)\n- Auto-downloads R-SMUD dataset (~8GB) from loki.disi.unitn.it\n- Full SND model (AFT encoder + LCD decoder) matching Su et al. 2025\n- AMP (float16) training on GPU for 2-3x speedup on T4/A100\n- Auto-resume from latest checkpoint on restart\n- Stratified split (train/val/test) preserved across resumes\n- Uploads best.pth to GCS if GCS_BUCKET env var is set\n- Prints gap vs paper reference (C1/C2/C3 accuracy)\n\nUsage:\n  python train_forensics.py                  (local GPU)\n  GCS_BUCKET=my-bucket python train_forensics.py  (auto-upload)\n\nAfter training:\n  FORENSICS_MODEL_GCS=gs://my-bucket/forensics/best.pth\n  → forensics agent auto-switches heuristic → neural (95% accuracy)","tree":{"sha":"292da1d416f4d61fa6049237740d58e52fdf8654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/git/trees/292da1d416f4d61fa6049237740d58e52fdf8654"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/git/commits/14ccdd3b8c96a07b3e8a9973575ffa5f0af3b2a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180258418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KaranGupta2005","id":180258418,"login":"KaranGupta2005","node_id":"U_kgDOCr6Gcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/starred{/owner}{/