e":"2026-06-08T16:16:35Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T16:16:35Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"message":"test: add pipeline integration test script\n\ntest_pipeline.py covers:\n- TEST 0: All imports (archivist, sentinel, forensics, audio_fp, spider)\n- TEST 1: Spider crawl with YouTube URL + title bypass\n- TEST 2: Forensics thumbnail analysis (heuristic mode)\n- TEST 3: Sentinel scan (skipped if vault empty, correct behavior)\n\nLocal results (confirmed working):\n- All imports OK\n- Spider found 16 suspects for test query\n- Forensics heuristic correctly detected WhatsApp/Telegram compression\n- Warnings (yt-dlp JS runtime, ffmpeg) are local-only; Docker resolves both","tree":{"sha":"90c7e9db24edc4778115af3a751e59e27320098b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/git/trees/90c7e9db24edc4778115af3a751e59e27320098b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/git/commits/7d59071a657e3c5577bc1ff5053ec4bb162e8c57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180258418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KaranGupta2005","id":180258418,"login":"KaranGupta2005","node_id":"U_kgDOCr6Gcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users