5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KaranGupta2005","id":180258418,"login":"KaranGupta2005","node_id":"U_kgDOCr6Gcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/commits/64eb3ca690b384f1840b737d6748ff3ccff1caea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T15:55:23Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T15:55:23Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"message":"fix: replace CLIP (350MB) with MobileNetV3 (22MB) to fix Render OOM\n\nCLIP ViT-B/32 downloads 350MB from HuggingFace during first ingest,\ncausing Render health check timeout + restart loop before embedding\ncan complete. MobileNetV3-Large is 22MB (bundled in torchvision),\nloads in <1s, produces same 512-dim L2-normalised embeddings for\ncosine similarity in FAISS. Piracy detection accuracy is preserved\nsince we do frame-level visual similarity, not cross-modal matching.\n\n- archivist.py: swap CLIPModel for MobileNetV3-Large + linear projection\n- requirements.txt: remove transformers, restore torchvision\n- Dockerfile.fastapi: add torchvision back to pip install","tree":{"sha":"010a802f5e84097c06888e87219d4fdd522e428a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prakhar14-op/MediaGuard-Sports/git/trees/010a802f5e840