 The changes made to fix the compatibility error.\n\n* Add tests for product inStock create/read round-trip\n\nAssert the create endpoint persists an out-of-stock status and that product reads expose the inStock field.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"a6e995eeb307f3ab362a1c60a834af10f54a1661","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/product-service/git/trees/a6e995eeb307f3ab362a1c60a834af10f54a1661"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/product-service/git/commits/f23d6ca4c7254ae17fed273bb6a010867770be11","verification":{"payload":"tree a6e995eeb307f3ab362a1c60a834af10f54a1661\nparent d497bcf7166068323b5eca4fdfa050c1f301e664\nauthor laythancarelse <168301887+laythancarelse@users.noreply.github.com> 1781703213 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781703213 +0400\n\nEnhancement/fix tool compatibilty (#7)\n\n* The changes made to fix the compatibility error.\n\n* Add tests for product inStock create/read round-trip\n\nAssert the create endpoint persists an out-of-stock status and that product reads expose the inStock field.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMqItCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPZsQAEiL4SoH7/U0SMvxZRyqAI7T\nT8NQJBdeC3gH5v5A+DU97DniU9TOKVeWFsGclUk+9/HVXrt5Ch4qTp3KyVAiqHmq\nu6zaqBlVNXkxNiu8IO6DfGj0wJdd8Yg2AQYm2A2DNgMW2dQ8UzHm2hu6neJjN4h7\naUITI5rUhPbX5lNzxxajFuvIkEvC3cZaaD8op35jd96iRFRqqNgQa4oeNz/93K9+\nHXyLxGo0IBrCd+dIO/tXhOK/9BR+isDFCeO83QlGnlTJdyEEB/XBoLr8mRC/KE7a\nmVqfSblKKXFEITHSxAL2qNXxnKB/A+fERLNwQRqUmI4ojA3IdO+2U3szvkbmfvwi\nVkjZVimHm/1NSWN4+kSBq7eLFX8BaKdR0qCCCmJmTb7jc87ZgK13fHxyX0d2xIic\n2dYmxIEIs7WeCg8G3KCwTQISnixOmUAxEubZhu73zdwRzhi33Kc1UqXdHPHY1Zll\nvHifzBZI94ZL1fnmnd80xb8+QLSwVfBAwmkQ/4hsyIVW8es4ciNd6+tiL8XJ1GRk\npjm4cDz7YCRq442k7mkwOfm8tsBK6wI7+UswlZC6Bhkq5HYlFx8bpsIaWbxgwdE/\nCDGXM0FviSff16dxv66lkQDqNv83t84pxvBgcqV