","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/product-service/commits/9d87afd198c41ee33cb63add39413a71e91bf816/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T16:04:53Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T16:09:29Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"fix: integrate CORS with Spring Security to allow cross-origin POST requests\n\nThe CorsFilter was running outside the Spring Security filter chain, so\nCORS preflight (OPTIONS) requests were blocked by authorizeHttpRequests\n(.anyRequest().denyAll()) before the CorsFilter could add the required\nAccess-Control-Allow-* headers. This caused all cross-origin POST/PUT/DELETE\nrequests to fail silently in the browser.\n\nChanges:\n- CorsConfig: expose CorsConfigurationSource bean instead of CorsFilter\n- SecurityConfig: enable .cors(Customizer.withDefaults()) so Spring Security\n  handles CORS preflights within its own filter chain\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"0a855407e1748ec49dacee3f413891af0faf7214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/product-service/git/trees/0a855407e1748ec49dacee3f413891af0faf7214"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/product-service/git/commits/9d87afd198c41ee33cb63add39413a71e91bf816","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at