blic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/product-service/commits/35d788ca636ba86286137a851cf579ff1dc23368/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:02:39Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:02:39Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"feat: add PostgreSQL persistence with Neon via Spring Data JPA\n\nReplace in-memory ConcurrentHashMap storage with persistent PostgreSQL\ndatabase using Spring Data JPA and Hibernate.\n\nChanges:\n- Add spring-boot-starter-data-jpa, PostgreSQL driver, H2 (test) deps\n- Convert Product model to JPA entity with table/column annotations\n- Add ProductRepository (JpaRepository)\n- Update ProductService to use repository instead of ConcurrentHashMap\n- Seed data only when database is empty (prevents duplicates on restart)\n- Configure DATABASE_URL env var for Neon PostgreSQL in production\n- Use H2 in-memory database for tests (no external DB required)\n- Update render.yaml with DATABASE_URL env var\n- Update README with database setup instructions\n- Update unit tests to mock repository layer\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"827fa1bc354685773df076829a7ea153557b38df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/product-service/git/trees/827fa1bc354685773df076829a7ea153557b38df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/product-service/git/commits/35d788ca636ba86286137a851cf579ff1dc23368","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","h