":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/product-service/commits/32b27a40c56b34907243d3d1b7a631094f108875/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:42:50Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:42:50Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"ci: upgrade actions to Node 24-native versions, remove FORCE workaround\n\nReplace all GitHub Actions with their Node.js 24-native releases:\n  actions/checkout          v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Aug 2025)\n  actions/setup-node        v4 → v6  (Node 24 since Sep 2025, v6 latest)\n  actions/setup-java        v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Aug 2025)\n  actions/cache             v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Dec 2025)\n  actions/cache/save        v4 → v5\n  actions/cache/restore     v4 → v5\n  actions/upload-artifact   v4 → v6  (Node 24 since Dec 2025)\n  actions/download-artifact v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Dec 2025)\n\nRemove FORCE_JAVASCRIPT_ACTIONS_TO_NODE24: true — this env var was a\ntemporary workaround that explicitly forced Node 20 actions to run on\nNode 24 and was itself the source of the ''being forced to run on\nNode.js 24'' warning text. With native Node 24 action versions, the\nworkaround and its warnings are no longer needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"087f738487bed1dfeb55485dee5f456386ffa1e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/product-service/git/trees/087f738487bed1dfeb55485dee5f456386ffa1e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/product-service/git/commits/32b27a40c56b34907243d3d1b7a631094f108875","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.c