htech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/commits/0cec157045017665b61abc89ce757155473e5472/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T16:05:00Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T16:05:00Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"fix: integrate CORS with Spring Security to allow cross-origin POST requests\n\nThe WebMvcConfigurer CORS config ran at the MVC level, after the Spring\nSecurity filter chain. CORS preflight (OPTIONS) requests were blocked by\nauthorizeHttpRequests (.anyRequest().denyAll()) before CORS headers could\nbe added. This caused all cross-origin POST requests to fail in the browser.\n\nChanges:\n- CorsConfig: replace WebMvcConfigurer with CorsConfigurationSource bean\n- SecurityConfig: enable .cors(Customizer.withDefaults()) so Spring Security\n  handles CORS preflights within its own filter chain\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"87a40dda565a795bbc11a9510c08efe197c4218c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/git/trees/87a40dda565a795bbc11a9510c08efe197c4218c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/git/commits/0c