oschtech/order-service/commits/c361007e3a09c5fa64bd33d7ea66cc9d7c6f32e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T15:55:58Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T15:55:58Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"fix: use Hibernate @UuidGenerator for auto-generating entity IDs\n\nPreviously, Order used manual UUID.randomUUID() in the constructor,\nwhich was overwritten by Jackson deserialization when the frontend sent\nid as null or empty — causing inserts to fail silently.\n\nChanges:\n- Replace manual UUID generation with @UuidGenerator on the id field\n- Add blank-ID guard in OrderService.createOrder()\n- Update model and service tests for null-id-before-persistence behavior\n- Document auto-generated ID in README\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"9e0cbf0521dfbed5bbddfa7185a3f7c1a794a9a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/git/trees/9e0cbf0521dfbed5bbddfa7185a3f7c1a794a9a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/git/commits/c361007e3a09c5fa64bd33d7ea66cc9d7c6f32e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https:/