s","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/commits/48e9111d0a9cec7368351233265a8d6bd39dfaae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:02:49Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:02:49Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"feat: add PostgreSQL persistence with Neon via Spring Data JPA\n\nReplace in-memory ConcurrentHashMap storage with persistent PostgreSQL\ndatabase using Spring Data JPA and Hibernate.\n\nChanges:\n- Add spring-boot-starter-data-jpa, PostgreSQL driver, H2 (test) deps\n- Convert Order model to JPA entity with table/column annotations\n- Add OrderRepository (JpaRepository) with findByProductId query\n- Update OrderService to use repository instead of ConcurrentHashMap\n- Seed data only when database is empty (prevents duplicates on restart)\n- Configure DATABASE_URL env var for Neon PostgreSQL in production\n- Use H2 in-memory database for tests (no external DB required)\n- Update render.yaml with DATABASE_URL env var\n- Add README with database setup instructions\n- Update unit and Pact tests for repository-backed service\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"77f3b19af6891ec7b3b3d039ff2bce3c6629e286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/git/trees/77f3b19af6891ec7b3b3d039ff2bce3c6629e286"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/git/commits/48e9111d0a9cec7368351233265a8d6bd39dfaae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/order-service/commit/48e9111d0a9cec7368351233265a8d6bd39dfaae","node_id":"C_kwDOSCieK9oAKDQ4ZTkxMTFkMGE5Y2VjNzM2ODM1MTIzMzI2NWE4ZDZiZDM5ZGZhYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/order-service/commit/8ab6f39f88b5ca9af830a80dd8730c36cc8dfe99","sha":"8ab6f39f88b5ca9af830a80dd8730c36cc8dfe99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/commits/8ab6f39f88b5ca9af830a80dd8730c36cc8dfe99"}],"sha":"48e9111d0a9cec7368351233265a8d6bd39dfaae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/commits/48e9111d0a9cec7368351233265a8d6bd39dfaae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/commits/8ab6f39f88b5ca9af830a80dd8730c36cc8dfe99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:42:48Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:42:48Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"ci: upgrade actions to Node 24-native versions, remove FORCE workaround\n\nReplace all GitHub Actions with their Node.js 24-native releases:\n  actions/checkout          v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Aug 2025)\n  actions/setup-node        v4 → v6  (Node 24 since Sep 2025, v6 latest)\n  actions/setup-java        v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Aug 2025)\n  actions/cache             v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Dec 2025)\n  actions/cache/save        v4 → v5\n  actions/cache/restore     v4 → v5\n  actions/upload-artifact   v4 → v6  (Node 24 since Dec 2025)\n  actions/download-artifact v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Dec 2025)\n\nRemove FORCE_JAVASCRIPT_ACTIONS_TO_NODE24: true — this env var was a\ntemporary workaround that explicitly forced Node 20 actions to run on\nNode 24 and was itself the source of the ''being forced to run on\nNode.js 24'' warning text. With native Node 24 action versions, the\nworkaround and its warnings are no longer needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"b3b241335894c061a19ef9ee9eb72f1dcf6e2d86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/git/trees/b3b241335894c061a19ef9ee9eb72f1dcf6e2d86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/git/commits/8ab6f39f88b5ca9af830a80dd8730c36cc8dfe99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/order-service/commit/8ab6f39f88b5ca9af830a80dd8730c36cc8dfe99","node_id":"C_kwDOSCieK9oAKDhhYjZmMzlmODhiNWNhOWFmODMwYTgwZGQ4NzMwYzM2Y2M4ZGZlOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/order-service/commit/1b094e5e1b08e9c3ea1fe5890816d24e39412965","sha":"1b094e5e1b08e9c3ea1fe5890816d24e39412965","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/commits/1b094