ithub.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/commits/7031f3e7f45a8f2e9926dda9402924f32486afa2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T14:30:30Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T14:30:30Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"ci: integrate AI-powered test analysis into E2E pipeline\n\nAdd AI analysis steps to the e2e-tests job (from ui-playwright-automation):\n- Smart regression selection (pre-test, determines --grep filter)\n- Failure RCA (on failure, classifies root cause)\n- Flaky test detection (always, flags inconsistent tests)\n- Defect auto-creation (on failure, creates GitHub issues)\n- API contract validation (always, validates response shapes)\n- Upload AI analysis reports artifact (history + contracts)\n\nAll AI steps are gated behind the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY secret and use\n|| true to never block the pipeline.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"21fd590df07e31009c33781e52db5a5d834e4e4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/git/trees/21fd590df07e31009c33781e52db5a5d834e4e4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/order-service/git/commits/7031f3e7f45a8f2e9926dda9402924f32486afa2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubus