Add playwright install to make setup, fix README test count\n\nReviewer dry-run from a fully clean environment (empty Docker, no\nnode_modules, no .env, no playwright cache) caught two paper cuts:\n\n1. make test-e2e fails for any reviewer without ms-playwright cached\n   from a prior project. Add `npx playwright install chromium` to the\n   setup target so first-run e2e Just Works.\n2. README claimed \"24 tests\" — actual count is 112 (49 backend + 63\n   frontend) after the test suite expansion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee98414838b5c1ae3b7e6aa44f1c90edd7ac63b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/trees/ee98414838b5c1ae3b7e6aa44f1c90edd7ac63b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/commits/c884b3a2651f549028365b171d2ead5e4b72b610","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/c884b3a2651f549028365b171d2ead5e4b72b610","node_id":"C_kwDOSCkZjNoAKGM4ODRiM2EyNjUxZjU0OTAyODM2NWIxNzFkMmVhZDVlNGI3MmI2MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/c9d6f622b100f1a5a6966bcbf50eeb9d01be134a","sha":"c9d6f622b100f1a5a6966bcbf50eeb9d01be134a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/c9d6f622b100f1a5a6966bcbf50eeb9d01be134a"}],"sha":"c884b3a2651f549028365b171d2ead5e4b72b610","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/c884b3a2651f549028365b171d2ead5e4b72b610"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/c9d6f622b100f1a5a6966bcbf50eeb9d01be134a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T00:18:02Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T00:18:02Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"message":"Fix make coverage: stage coverage JSONs into single dir for nyc merge\n\nnyc merge accepts only one input directory but the Makefile was\npassing both packages/backend/coverage and packages/frontend/coverage\nas positional args, producing ''Too many non-option arguments: got 1,\nmaximum of 0'' and aborting before the combined report was generated.\n\nStage both coverage-final.json files into coverage/raw/ as a single\ninput directory for nyc merge, and point nyc report at the same\ndirectory. Also wire in the Postgres prerequisites so coverage runs\ncleanly from a cold start, matching the existing test target.\n\nCombined coverage (true merged) is 79.53% statements / 77.02%\nbranches / 85.13% functions; per-package figures are unchanged.\n\nCloses bmad-sdd-leapsome-8aw\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d78f478070c3a5d5dc59f29a620cf388884a0d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/trees/5d78f478070c3a5d5dc59f29a620cf388884a0d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/commits/c9d6f622b100f1a5a6966bcbf50eeb9d01be134a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_