om/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/5e2a5303d97d831d5b92bc1dfd4d7f1eb25894b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T19:54:30Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T19:54:30Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"message":"Fix health check not detecting backend-down on fresh page load\n\nThe health check required 2 consecutive failures before setting\nisBackendDown, but refetchInterval only polled when isBackendDown was\nalready true -- a chicken-and-egg deadlock. On a fresh load with\nbackend down, the health query fired once, failed, and never polled\nagain. The placeholder never changed to \"Backend unavailable...\" and\nthe input stayed enabled.\n\nFix: poll continuously (30s interval always active) and trust that\nretry:1 in TanStack Query already provides 2 failed attempts before\nisError triggers. Also invalidate the health query on Retry so the\nerror banner clears immediately on recovery.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89556b0a50e96c101fcce7bc6c414b5948f569ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/trees/89556b0a50e96c101fcce7bc6c414b5948f569ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/commits/5e2a5303d97d831d5b92bc1dfd4d7f1eb25894b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/5e2a5303d97d831d5b92bc1dfd4d7f1eb25894b2","node_id":"C_kwDOSCkZjNoAKDVlMmE1MzAzZDk3ZDgzMWQ1YjkyYmMxZGZkNGQ3ZjFlYjI1ODk0YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/25932388c5147ea8cf01755c1a341e4df813278f","sha":"25932388c5147ea8cf01755c1a341e4df813278f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/25932388c5147ea8cf01755c1a341e4df813278f"}],"sha":"5e2a5303d97d831d5b92bc1dfd4d7f1eb25894b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/5e2a5303d97d831d5b92bc1dfd4d7f1eb25894b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/25932388c5147ea8cf01755c1a341e4df813278f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T19:47:42Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T19:47:42Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"message":"Fix per-page dropdown disappearing when all items fit on one page\n\nWhen changing the limit to a value that fits all items (e.g. 50 for 22\nitems), the Pagination component returned null — hiding the dropdown\nalong with the page buttons. This trapped users at the higher limit\nwith no way to change back.\n\nNow page buttons hide independently while the dropdown always remains\nvisible. The entire pagination bar hides only when total items <= 10\n(the smallest limit option), since the dropdown is irrelevant then.\n\nAlso clears the stale page announcement on limit change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e99e2d4eeb8c69fb244c2788288ea77342f717f7","url":"htt