"message":"Fix E2E tests to use todo_test database, not dev database\n\nE2E tests were running against the dev database (todo), wiping developer\ndata with clearAllTodos in beforeEach. Now:\n- Playwright webServer starts backend with DATABASE_URL=todo_test\n- CI runs migrations on both todo and todo_test databases\n- make test-e2e ensures todo_test exists before running\n- Developer''s todo database is never touched by tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae980edb580209a758bd463ccd2c7a47739dd040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/trees/ae980edb580209a758bd463ccd2c7a47739dd040"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/commits/d31d2cb315f59c1e8c14aff797ea284359264476","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/d31d2cb315f59c1e8c14aff797ea284359264476","node_id":"C_kwDOSCkZjNoAKGQzMWQyY2IzMTVmNTljMWU4YzE0YWZmNzk3ZWEyODQzNTkyNjQ0NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/dc3d28919cd52cd4fd0fa420ddfc53d1d1daf469","sha":"dc3d28919cd52cd4fd0fa420ddfc53d1d1daf469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/dc3d28919cd52cd4fd0fa420ddfc53d1d1daf469"}],"sha":"d31d2cb315f59c1e8c14aff797ea284359264476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/d31d2cb315f59c1e8c14aff797ea284359264476"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/dc3d28919cd52cd4fd0fa420ddfc53d1d1daf469/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T17:23:03Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T17:23:03Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"message":"Fix ErrorBanner flashing on initial page load\n\nThe health check marked the backend as down on the very first failure,\nwhich always happened during dev startup (backend still booting). Now\nrequires either a previous successful health check OR 2+ consecutive\nfailures before showing the banner. Also added retry: 1 to the health\nquery so a single transient failure doesn''t trigger the banner.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71ffdd700f9cd87a6c545818034e1e649534929a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/trees/71ffdd700f9cd87a6c545818034e1e649534929a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/commits/dc3d28919cd52cd4fd0fa420ddfc53d1d1daf469","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/dc3d28919cd52cd4fd0fa420ddfc53d1d1daf469","node_id":"C_kwDOSCkZjNoAKGRjM2QyODkxOWNkNTJjZDRmZDBmYTQyMGRkZmM1M2QxZDFkYWY0Njk","parents":[{"html_url"