lone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/2991a8769eb441cacd701ed05d60cb6302fadc6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T18:51:48Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T18:51:48Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"message":"Add E2E tests to CI, coverage badge, CI status badge in README\n\nCI pipeline now includes:\n- Playwright Chromium install + E2E test execution (8 tests)\n- 2 retries in CI for resilience\n- Coverage badge auto-generated on main push via shields.io endpoint\n- Playwright report uploaded as artifact on failure\n\nE2E test stability fixes:\n- Explicit waitFor on listitem/text after API data creation\n- Verify clearAllTodos actually completed before proceeding\n- API verification before page load in limit dropdown test\n- Increased timeouts (action: 10s, expect: 10s, test: 30s)\n\nREADME badges:\n- CI status badge (GitHub Actions)\n- Coverage badge (shields.io endpoint from .github/badges/coverage.json)\n\nPost-Zodios coverage verified: backend 77.84%, frontend 82.42% (both >70%)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0acb92ffa7051ddc09e274d654082561f945e391","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/tr