0:43Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"message":"Fix CI: move client.ts out of gitignored generated/ directory\n\nThe hand-written client.ts was in packages/api-spec/generated/ which is\ngitignored. In CI after codegen, only types.ts and schemas.ts exist —\nclient.ts was missing. Moved to packages/api-spec/src/client.ts (not\ngenerated, not gitignored). Updated package exports and vitest aliases.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb17b4dd5b8bc5a332bb560fc7613529d4079165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/trees/cb17b4dd5b8bc5a332bb560fc7613529d4079165"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/commits/2185ffe726ee87fd06e7c901c68a8964e44521df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/2185ffe726ee87fd06e7c901c68a8964e