https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/eddef646c2fbfcebd9843585ad8ddf4830b6d68a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T22:29:20Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T22:29:20Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"message":"Add QA reports, fix Docker production issues, verify docker-compose e2e\n\nQA Reports:\n- Coverage report: inventoried gaps, prioritized test plan for 70%\n- Accessibility report: WCAG AA compliant, 7 low-severity findings\n- Security report: OWASP Top 10 review, 10 findings (1 medium: no auth)\n\nDocker fixes (found during e2e verification):\n- api-spec: conditional exports (types/default) + tsc build step so\n  generated .ts files compile to .js for production runtime\n- docker-compose: override NODE_ENV=production, use service hostname\n  for DATABASE_URL, fix health check IPv6 (127.0.0.1 not localhost)\n- All 3 services verified healthy: health endpoint, API CRUD, frontend\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f091140f4d0375cc2b62d11dccaa45e14a026e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/trees/1f091140f4d0375cc2b62d11dccaa45e14a026e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/commits/eddef646c2fbfcebd9843585ad8ddf4830b6d68a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2211723