iccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/0182548fc5378d2519bf23f3a2639499cdfa2962/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T21:38:19Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T21:38:19Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"message":"Add Playwright E2E tests, Dockerfiles, and docker-compose services\n\nE2E (8 tests):\n- 7 todo tests: create, complete, delete, empty state, pagination,\n  edit description, limit dropdown\n- 1 accessibility test: axe-core WCAG audit\n- webServer config auto-starts backend + frontend\n- Test isolation via API-based setup/teardown\n\nDocker:\n- Backend Dockerfile: multi-stage, runs codegen in build, non-root,\n  includes api-spec generated files for runtime imports\n- Frontend Dockerfile: multi-stage, nginx with SPA fallback, caching,\n  gzip, non-root on port 5173\n- docker-compose.yml: postgres + backend + frontend with health checks\n- .dockerignore: excludes node_modules, .git, coverage, etc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83102e0809805c3f54c43339d6021668c72343ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/trees/83102e0809805c3f54c43339d6021668c72343ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/commits/0182548fc5378d2519bf23f3a2639499cdfa2962","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/0182548fc5378d2519bf23f3a2639499cdfa2962","node_id":"C_kwDOSCkZjNoAKDAxODI1NDhmYzUzNzhkMjUxOWJmMjNmM2EyNjM5NDk5Y2RmYTI5NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/690fc943162c7c9da9e26d0394e8154388facb8c","sha":"690fc943162c7c9da9e26d0394e8154388facb8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/690fc943162c7c9da9e26d0394e8154388facb8c"}],"sha":"0182548fc5378d2519bf23f3a2639499cdfa2962","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/0182548fc5378d2519bf23f3a2639499cdfa2962"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/690fc943162c7c9da9e26d0394e8154388facb8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T21:25:13Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T21:25:13Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"message":"Implement all CRUD routes, UI components, and responsive styling\n\nBackend (5 routes):\n- GET /health with 3s statement_timeout, 503 on DB failure\n- POST /api/todos with Zod validation, sanitization, UUIDv7\n- GET /api/todos with offset pagination, composite ordering\n- PATCH /api/todos/:id with upsert, UUID validation, min 1 field\n- DELETE /api/todos/:id always 204 (idempotent)\n- Graceful shutdown (SIGTERM/SIGINT closes server + DB)\n\nFrontend (6 components):\n- TodoItem: Radix Checkbox, inline edit, delete, optimistic updates,\n  pending/error states, 429 discrimination, accessibility\n- TodoList: maps todos, delegates to EmptyState when total=0\n- TodoForm: create mutation, client-side validation, disabled when\n  backend down\n- Pagination: page numbers, Radix Select for limit, aria-live\n  announcements\n- LoadingState: CSS spinner, retry messaging\n- EmptyState: distinct from loading, friendly copy\n\nStyling:\n- Global CSS reset with focus-visible rings\n- Design tokens on :root, all components use custom properties\n- Responsive 320px-1024px+, 44x44 touch targets, centered layout\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b7208bc74ca9125969a804ac1a59f3597aedf06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/trees/5b7208bc74ca9125969a804ac1a59f3597aedf06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/commits/690fc943162c7c9da9e26d0394e8154388facb8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/690fc943162c7c9da9e26d0394e8154388facb8c","node_id":"C_kwDOSCkZjNoAKDY5MGZjOTQzMTYyYzdjOWRhOWUyNmQwMzk0ZTgxNTQzODhmYWNiOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commit/577c25581bb00af75b7a650d74e0a9c4d2c00f06","sha":"577c25581bb00af75b7a650d74e0a9c4d2c00f06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/577c25581bb00af75b7a650d74e0a9c4d2c00f06"}],"sha":"690fc943162c7c9da9e26d0394e8154388facb8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/690fc943162c7c9da9e26d0394e8154388facb8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/commits/577c25581bb00af75b7a650d74e0a9c4d2c00f06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T21:13:04Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T21:13:04Z","email":"nathanjbarlow@gmail.com","name":"Nathan Barlow"},"message":"Add backend infra, frontend infra, CI pipeline, and docs structure\n\nCompletes 6 stories in parallel:\n- Fastify app with CORS, rate limiting, Pino structured logging\n- Drizzle schema with todos table, composite index, seed (20 items)\n- React app shell with QueryClientProvider, ErrorBoundary, ErrorBanner\n  (health poll + auto-recovery), aria-live regions, AppContext\n- TanStack Query hooks: useTodos, useCreateTodo, useToggleTodo,\n  useDeleteTodo, useUpdateDescription, useHealthCheck — all with\n  optimistic updates, snapshot/rollback, 429 discrimination\n- GitHub Actions CI: Node 20, Postgres service, spec-lint, codegen,\n  compile check, test\n- MkDocs + ReadTheDocs config, developer setup docs\n- Design tokens with WCAG AA verified contrast ratios\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ec8464f83a9cda2e7bf08aac70eccb99e4b4fca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/trees/6ec8464f83a9cda2e7bf08aac70eccb99e4b4fca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soniccyclone/bmad-sdd-leapsome/git/commits/577c25581bb00af75b7a650d74e0a9c4d2c00f06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22117232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyclone","id":22117232,"login":"soniccyclone","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE3MjMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soniccyclone","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/soniccyc