htech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/micro-frontend/commits/7eaa53f721cc9f420734699ab1ce4dbf0c959838/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T17:05:38Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T17:05:38Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"fix: revert proxy routes, use direct backend URLs with CORS\n\nThe wildcard rewrite routes (/api/products/* → external URL) broke\nRender''s static site routing entirely, causing 404s on all pages\nincluding SPA routes.\n\nReverted render.yaml to the original routes (health checks + SPA\nfallback only). Set the backend service URLs directly in .env.production\nso the frontend makes cross-origin requests — the backend CORS fix\n(already merged) handles these correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"896b2817ef97938c6102271e497faf68b9577761","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/micro-frontend/git/trees/896b2817ef97938c6102271e497faf68b9577761"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/micro-frontend/git/commits/7eaa53f721cc9f420734699ab1ce4dbf0c959838","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos"