tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/micro-frontend/commits/3ef267d1b63c019a1e3d01fa047da663a94e2a5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:29:54Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:29:54Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"ci: standardize Node 24 across all workflow steps and set FORCE_JAVASCRIPT_ACTIONS_TO_NODE24\n\n- Rename all ''Setup Node 20'' step labels to ''Setup Node 24'' to match the\n  actual node-version: 24 value (cosmetic but eliminates confusion)\n- Fix order-service and product-service pact-contract-tests steps which\n  were still on node-version: 22 and the e2e steps on node-version: 20;\n  align everything to 24 for consistency with micro-frontend engine\n  requirement (>=24.0.0)\n- Add FORCE_JAVASCRIPT_ACTIONS_TO_NODE24: true env at workflow level to\n  ensure the GitHub Actions runner itself also uses Node 24 instead of\n  the default Actions-bundled Node version\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"4e9c1632c7031ddc2dc17403a5f3f0752dd9f98a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/micro-frontend/git/trees/4e9c1632c7031ddc2dc17403a5f3f0752dd9f98a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/micro-frontend/git/commits/3ef267d1b63c019a1e3d01fa047da663a94e2a5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gr