riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/micro-frontend/commits/67539773cb0cf16940b45fa58e35b7fa269ebd31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:27:47Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:27:47Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"fix: add retry for Pact contract tests in CI to handle intermittent mock server failures\n\nThe Pact Rust FFI mock server occasionally fails to bind its port fast\nenough under CI resource contention, causing one of the interactions to\nreport ''request not received'' even though no bug exists in the consumer\ncode. This is a known transient timing issue with the Pact native library.\n\nFix:\n- Add { retry: process.env.CI ? 2 : 0 } to both contract describe blocks\n  so vitest retries failing tests up to 2 times in CI only (0 retries\n  locally to keep the feedback loop fast).\n- Add // @vitest-sequential true so the two contract test files never run\n  simultaneously, eliminating any residual port-conflict risk.\n\nVerified: all 166 tests and >95% coverage thresholds pass on Node 24.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"571a25a8fac98ebcce54ce03e6ca7abb5411ec9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/micro-frontend/git/trees/571a25a8fac98ebcce54ce03e6ca7abb5411ec9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/micro-frontend/git/commits/67539773cb0cf16940b45fa58e35b7fa269ebd31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://