/api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/micro-frontend/commits/3d7516bb150a1df73fb17255c8cf92e7cf5ba183/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T18:31:43Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T18:31:43Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"chore: upgrade micro-frontend to Node.js 22\n\n- Bump every ''node-version: 20'' in .github/workflows/ci.yml to 22 so the\n  lint, unit-tests, component-tests, contract-tests, a11y-tests,\n  coverage, build, and e2e-tests jobs all run on Node 22 (matching the\n  order-service and product-service pipelines).\n- Pin local toolchain with a .nvmrc (22).\n- Declare ''engines.node'' >= 22.0.0 in package.json so local installs and\n  CI surface a mismatched Node version early via npm''s EBADENGINE.\n\nVerified locally on Node 22.11.0:\n  lint          ✓\n  typecheck     ✓\n  test:unit     ✓ 95/95\n  test:component ✓ 39/39\n  test:contract ✓ 10/10\n  test:a11y     ✓ 22/22\n  test:coverage ✓ 100/98.88/100/100 (clears 95% gate)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"7af5e55da0b55deecc70d680b60126437b6f1c98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/micro-frontend/git/trees/7af5e55da0b55deecc70d680b6