cc97c99c1daf420dd92aa230c51798a"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:39:28.344Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/07a91933e3f05a36d9c8918ece7f3de295aef805/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:46:42Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:46:42Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"message":"chore: release v2.1.2\n\n* (ticaki) fixed: when Apple requires the account holder to accept updated iCloud terms and conditions (`termsUpdateNeeded`; Find My answers `HTTP 450` although the session is valid), the adapter stops with a clear error message — accept the terms at icloud.com or on an Apple device and start the instance again — instead of re-authenticating in an endless loop\n* (ticaki) fixed: a session recovery now performs a real re-login — session token and cookies are dropped, the trust token is kept so no new MFA is required — and backs off (10 s, 1 min, 5 min, 15 min, 30 min) when it keeps failing, instead of re-validating the same session token every 10 s\n* (ticaki) new: option \"Accept updated iCloud terms automatically\" (off by default) — when Apple flags the account with `termsUpdateNeeded`, the adapter fetches the current terms version via `/getTerms`, confirms it via `/repairDone` and re-runs `accountLogin`, the way pyicloud''s `accept_terms` does; enabling it means agreeing to Apple''s terms without reading them\n* (ticaki) fixed: a failed refresh during startup no longer reports \"iCloud connection established\"","tree":{"sha":"28dbba3d4e04e13ae42050aa2db4eebfd1bb89d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/28dbba3d4e04e13ae42050aa2db4eebfd1bb89d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/07a91933e3f05a36d9c8918ece7f3de295aef805","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/07a91933e3f05a36d9c8918ece7f3de295aef805","node_id":"C_kwDOSDKl4NoAKDA3YTkxOTMzZTNmMDVhMzZkOWM4OTE4ZWNlN2YzZGUyOTVhZWY4MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/de1d40c9008b1c540e073dd27cb848a37fc30e79","sha":"de1d40c9008b1c540e073dd27cb848a37fc30e79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/de1d40c9008b1c540e073dd27cb848a37fc30e79"}],"sha":"07a91933e3f05a36d9c8918ece7f3de295aef805","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/07a91933e3f05a36d9c8918ece7f3de295aef805"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/de1d40c9008b1c540e073dd27cb848a37fc30e79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:44:32Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:44:32Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"message":"feat(config): option to accept updated iCloud terms automatically\n\nNew checkbox \"Accept updated iCloud terms automatically\" (acceptTermsAutomatically,\noff by default, help text in all 11 languages). When Apple flags the account with\ntermsUpdateNeeded and Find My answers HTTP 450, the adapter now — instead of\nstopping — fetches the current terms version via /getTerms, confirms it via\n/repairDone and re-runs accountLogin, mirroring pyicloud''s accept_terms. Apple\nanswers these setup endpoints for POST like for pyicloud''s GET-with-body, which\nnative fetch cannot send. Verified live: repairDone {\"success\":true}, the next\nscheduled Find My refresh returned 38 devices again.\n\nThe error message of the stop path now points at the new option.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"01305874c7e4c8177142a3f2472a96ac216aecea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/01305874c7e4c8177142a3f2472a96ac216aecea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/de1d40c9008b1c540e073dd27cb848a37fc30e79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/de1d40c9008b1c540e073dd27cb848a37fc30e79","node_id":"C_kwDOSDKl4NoAKGRlMWQ0MGM5MDA4YjFjNTQwZTA3M2RkMjdjYjg0OGEzN2ZjMzBlNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/763dadedd43d589c01e7c825348f4f59f62157ab","sha":"763dadedd43d589c01e7c825348f4f59f62157ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/763dadedd43d589c01e7c825348f4f59f62157ab"}],"sha":"de1d40c9008b1c540e073dd27cb848a37fc30e79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/de1d40c9008b1c540e073dd27cb848a37fc30e79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/763dadedd43d589c01e7c825348f4f59f62157ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:36:06Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:36:06Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"message":"fix(session): stop on unaccepted iCloud terms, real re-login with backoff on recovery\n\nFind My answered HTTP 450 on every request although /validate, a fresh SRP\nsign-in and accountLogin all succeeded (hsaTrustedBrowser=true). The debug\ndump of accountLogin showed the actual cause: termsUpdateNeeded=true — Apple\npublished updated iCloud terms the account holder has not accepted yet, and\nrejects service requests until then.\n\n* main: on Find My 450 with accountInfo.termsUpdateNeeded the adapter logs a\n  clear error (accept the terms at icloud.com or on an Apple device, then start\n  the instance again) and terminates with ADAPTER_REQUESTED_TERMINATION so the\n  controller does not restart it, instead of re-authenticating in a loop.\n* main: triggerSessionRecovery() drops session token + cookies via the new\n  iCloudService.invalidateSession() (trust token kept, no new MFA) — before, the\n  re-auth validated the very same session token and reproduced the identical\n  state every 10 s. Consecutive recoveries back off 10 s → 1 → 5 → 15 → 30 min\n  and reset after an hour of quiet.\n* main: onICloudReady() returns early when a refresh triggered a recovery, so a\n  failed startup no longer logs \"iCloud connection established\".\n* lib: debug log of hsaTrustedBrowser / hsaChallengeRequired / apps.find /\n  termsUpdateNeeded after accountLogin; Find My logs the response headers of a\n  rejected refreshClient call.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18b02432b9627273aad161756acd5d69288f4d25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/18b02432b9627273aad161756acd5d69288f4d25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/763dadedd43d589c01e7c825348f4f59f62157ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"