":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:14:47Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"message":"build(admin): bump @iobroker/json-config to 10.0.1 to match gui-components 10.2.3\n\nDependabot raised @iobroker/gui-components to 10.2.3, which replaced\nreact-color with react-colorful. @iobroker/json-config 9.0.18 still imports\nreact-color (relying on it transitively), so the admin build failed with\n\"Rollup failed to resolve import react-color\". json-config 10.0.1 targets\ngui-components ^10.2.3. Rebuilt admin/custom.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87807b019168526e1f4dd816cb172b1269b6801c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/87807b019168526e1f4dd816cb172b1269b6801c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/7fd5cb60a833393443c709b4c885af5c558bbf26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/7fd5cb60a833393443c709b4c885af5c558bbf