/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/4d61db1abd5e91f5c194fabfeb7a414bf2ccf2d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:10:32Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:10:32Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"message":"fix(findmy): drop eager refresh in service constructor that crashed the adapter\n\niCloudFindMyService started a fire-and-forget refresh() in its constructor,\nin parallel to the adapter''s own explicit refresh() call. Both requests raced\nthrough refreshWebservices(); on a persistent HTTP 450 the constructor''s\npromise had no handler and killed the adapter with UNCAUGHT_EXCEPTION.\nThe adapter''s call already handles errors and triggers session recovery.\n\nfix(reminders): sanitize U+2028/U+2029 and control characters in decoded text\n\nApple emits LINE/PARAGRAPH SEPARATOR for soft line breaks; JSON.stringify\nleaves them unescaped, which breaks line-based tooling (backup/restore).\nMap them to \\n and strip remaining C0/C1 control characters.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b1e639ad7dab123fbd1984818672e07efd2c28a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/1b1e639ad7dab123fbd1984818672e07efd2c28a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/4d61db1abd5e91f5c194fabfeb7a414bf2ccf2d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"http