d: the warning about a reconstructed calendar list now states how many calendars could be completed with their real metadata, and a title delivered by Apple is no longer overwritten by the one stored from an earlier refresh","tree":{"sha":"49ea79c1faf3ee48a50e72def4315962072538f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/49ea79c1faf3ee48a50e72def4315962072538f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/145c3bf0795089739c815f830d02a83e3df53f18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/145c3bf0795089739c815f830d02a83e3df53f18","node_id":"C_kwDOSDKl4NoAKDE0NWMzYmYwNzk1MDg5NzM5YzgxNWY4MzBkMDJhODNlM2RmNTNmMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/565c6094a470da57f1e4e8304d5af47ae6f8c61a","sha":"565c6094a470da57f1e4e8304d5af47ae6f8c61a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/565c6094a470da57f1e4e8304d5af47ae6f8c61a"}],"sha":"145c3bf0795089739c815f830d02a83e3df53f18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/145c3bf0795089739c815f830d02a83e3df53f18"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/565c6094a470da57f1e4e8304d5af47ae6f8c61a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T08:50:30Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T08:50:30Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"message":"chore: release v2.0.4\n\n* (ticaki) fixed: the calendar could fail permanently with `WEBSERVICE_REAUTH_REQUIRED:calendar` although the session was still valid — the service re-authentication no longer posts the account password to Apple''s `accountLogin` (which answers HTTP 421 for every account with two-factor authentication) but refreshes the webservices with the session token, the way FindMy has been doing it all along\n* (ticaki) fixed: an empty HTTP 500 is no longer mistaken for an expired session — only a real HTTP 401 triggers a calendar re-authentication now\n* (ticaki) fixed: when Apple refuses `/ca/startup`, the calendar list is now taken from a single-day `/startup` request and, if that fails too, reconstructed from the `pGuid`s of `/ca/events` — the adapter delivers the events instead of aborting the whole refresh, and a reconstructed list never deletes existing calendar objects\n* (ticaki) changed: the calendar service now picks up the calendar partition URL returned by a re-authentication instead of reusing the cached one","tree":{"sha":"3e1ad6a8dd0ba43e74d9381eda1672b77e4e4ddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/3e1ad6a8dd0ba43e74d9381eda1672b77e4e4ddc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/565c6094a470da57f1e4e8304d5af47ae6f8c61a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/565c6094a470da57f1e4e8304d5af47ae6f8c61a","node_id":"C_kwDOSDKl4NoAKDU2NWM2MDk0YTQ3MGRhNTdmMWU0ZTgzMDRkNWFmNDdhZTZmOGM2MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/50dd143711d5849b800eb3e4024941832ccdb563","sha":"50dd143711d5849b800eb3e4024941832ccdb563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/50dd143711d5849b800eb3e4024941832ccdb563"}],"sha":"565c6094a470da57f1e4e8304d5af47ae6f8c61a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/565c6094a470da57f1e4e8304d5af47ae6f8c61a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/50dd143711d5849b800eb3e4024941832ccdb563/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T08:49:18Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T08:49:18Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"message":"fix(calendar): stop the broken service reauth from failing valid sessions\n\nA forum log showed the whole picture: /ca/startup fails with an empty 500,\nauthenticateWebService(\"calendar\") answers 421, and the /events counter-probe\nright after returns 54 events with the very same cookies. The session was\nnever the problem.\n\n* authenticateWebService() posted appName + apple_id + password to\n  accountLogin (pyicloud''s _authenticate_with_credentials_service). With SRP\n  and 2FA in place Apple answers 421 to that every time, so the call could\n  never repair anything — it only kept sending the account password and\n  turned Apple''s error into WEBSERVICE_REAUTH_REQUIRED. It now refreshes the\n  webservices with the session token, the way FindMy already did.\n* An empty 5xx no longer triggers a calendar reauth; only a real 401 does.\n* fetchStartup() falls back twice before giving up: /startup for a single day\n  (Collection[] does not depend on the range) and, failing that, a calendar\n  list reconstructed from the pGuids of /events, flagged as degraded.\n* refreshCalendarEvents() restores the titles of a reconstructed list from the\n  existing objects and skips the cleanup, so calendars without events in the\n  range are not deleted.\n* The calendar service picks up the partition URL returned by a reauth instead\n  of reusing the cached one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Nysx5hXatSyJF78D4Ujjic","tree":{"sha":"a9ef8aa92065dfd6d8327b4dcb5f0d13171a862b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/a9ef8aa92065dfd6d8327b4dcb5f0d13171a862b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/50dd143711d5849b800eb3e4024941832ccdb563","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/50dd143711d5849b800eb3e4024941832ccdb563","node_id":"C_kwDOSDKl4NoAKDUwZGQxNDM3MTFkNTg0OWI4MDBlYjNlNDAyNDk0MTgzMmNjZGI1NjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/88b967e076c245dfc52963754ac551c8cbd8f30b","sha":"88b967e076c245dfc52963754ac551c8cbd8f30b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/88b967e076c245dfc52963754ac551c8cbd8f30b"}],"sha":"50dd143711d5849b800eb3e4024941832ccdb563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/50dd143711d5849b800eb3e4024941832ccdb563"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/88b967e076c245dfc52963754ac551c8cbd8f30b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:43:05Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:43:05Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"message":"chore: release v2.0.3\n\n* (ticaki) fixed: requesting a 2FA code by SMS could fail with `SMS request failed (500)` — the session is now refreshed directly before the request and a rejected request is retried once with the complete phone number payload\n* (ticaki) fixed: calendar requests now carry the `clientBuildNumber` / `clientMasteringNumber` / `clientId` parameters that Apple''s own web client sends — without them stricter calendar servers answered with an empty HTTP 500\n* (ticaki) changed: failed SMS and calendar requests now report Apple''s actual error (service errors, edge headers) instead of a truncated JSON fragment, and all adapter messages are English now","tree":{"sha":"905f067b74e9a92d1740a756e17f45686b31dc08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/905f067b74e9a92d1740a756e17f45686b31dc08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/88b967e076c245dfc52963754ac551c8cbd8f30b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/88b967e076c245dfc52963754ac551c8cbd8f30b","node_id":"C_kwDOSDKl4NoAKDg4Yjk2N2UwNzZjMjQ1ZGZjNTI5NjM3NTRhYzU1MWM4Y2JkOGYzMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/724071b0b8a20c11e3d3e6542cab9b379757f43f","sha":"724071b0b8a20c11e3d3e6542cab9b379757f43f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/724071b0b8a20c11e3d3e6542cab9b379757f43f"}],"sha":"88b967e076c245dfc52963754ac551c8cbd8f30b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/88b967e076c245dfc52963754ac551c8cbd8f30b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/724071b0b8a20c11e3d3e6542cab9b379757f43f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T00:06:39Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T00:06:39Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"message":"feat(calendar): counter-probe /events when /startup fails\n\nA failing /ca/startup on its own does not say what refused it. /ca/events\nruns against the same host, cookies and query parameters but a different\nbackend, so probing it once tells the two cases apart: an answering\n/events means Apple serves the account''s events but not its calendar\nlist (calendar likely not enabled for iCloud), while both failing alike\npoints at the session or the partition.\n\nThe probe runs only after /startup has already failed, skips the retry\npath and never changes the outcome — the original error is rethrown\nunchanged. Cost is one request per failed refresh.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YQbnjiiWo5166zL3eZiLwV","tree":{"sha":"a1630e036605202d4cb1f85c11f44045e94462ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/a1630e036605202d4cb1f85c11f44045e94462ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/724071b0b8a20c11e3d3e6542cab9b379757f43f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/724071b0b8a20c11e3d3e6542cab9b379757f43f","node_id":"C_kwDOSDKl4NoAKDcyNDA3MWIwYjhhMjBjMTFlM2QzZTY1NDJjYWI5YjM3OTc1N2Y0M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/20a49cb103311bffa5d3ff4965e1b710b2a06dae","sha":"20a49cb103311bffa5d3ff4965e1b710b2a06dae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/20a49cb103311bffa5d3ff4965e1b710b2a06dae"}],"sha":"724071b0b8a20c11e3d3e6542cab9b379757f43f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/724071b0b8a20c11e3d3e6542cab9b379757f43f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/20a49cb103311bffa5d3ff4965e1b710b2a06dae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T23:56:29Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T23:56:29Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"message":"fix(calendar): send the client identifiers Apple expects\n\nEvery calendar request went out without clientBuildNumber,\nclientMasteringNumber and clientId. pyicloud builds each calendar\nrequest as dict(self.params) plus lang/usertz/startDate/endDate, and\nApple''s web client sends the same identifiers; the adapter has them in\ngetParams() and uses them for contacts and the PCS endpoints, but the\ncalendar service never did. Apple answers a request missing them with\nHTTP 500 and an empty body on the stricter partitions, which matches the\nreports: calendar sync never worked for the affected users, while others\nare fine.\n\nAlso re-authenticate on an empty 5xx, not only on 401 — some partitions\nanswer a missing/expired X-APPLE-WEBAUTH-* cookie that way, and the\nadapter stayed broken until the next restart.\n\nWhen a request fails, log Apple''s edge headers (request uuid, responding\ninstance, retry-after, age, via, content-length). An empty 500 without\nthem cannot be told apart from a CDN or gateway problem.\n\nThe ADP warning of the notes and reminders services is English now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YQbnjiiWo5166zL3eZiLwV","tree":{"sha":"0a682657ffd998034e65750e68fd5df45ea2a65f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/0a682657ffd998034e65750e68fd5df45ea2a65f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/20a49cb103311bffa5d3ff4965e1b710b2a06dae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/20a49cb103311bffa5d3ff4965e1b710b2a06dae","node_id":"C_kwDOSDKl4NoAKDIwYTQ5Y2IxMDMzMTFiZmZhNWQzZmY0OTY1ZTFiNzEwYjJhMDZkYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/33a6d1ff7c8a5528310972bf466ac30a8be9caab","sha":"33a6d1ff7c8a5528310972bf466ac30a8be9caab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/33a6d1ff7c8a5528310972bf466ac30a8be9caab"}],"sha":"20a49cb103311bffa5d3ff4965e1b710b2a06dae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/20a49cb103311bffa5d3ff4965e1b710b2a06dae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commits/33a6d1ff7c8a5528310972bf466ac30a8be9caab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T23:56:02Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T23:56:02Z","email":"github@renopoint.de","name":"ticaki"},"message":"fix(auth): refresh session before SMS request, surface Apple''s error\n\nThe SMS code request is triggered by the user, minutes after sign-in and\nalways after the automatic trusted-device push. Apple rotates scnt,\nsession id and auth attributes along the way and answers a verify/phone\nthat carries stale ones with an empty HTTP 500. Re-read the auth options\nright before the request — that refreshes those headers and returns the\ncurrently valid phone number ids.\n\nRetry a 5xx once with the complete phone object from the auth options\ninstead of the minimal { id, nonFTEU } form, mirroring what Apple''s own\nweb client round-trips.\n\nDiagnosis: the response was truncated at 200 characters, but Apple\npretty-prints the (irrelevant) obfuscated phone number first, so the\ndecisive serviceErrors block never made it into the log. Log the full\nbody and translate serviceErrors / securityCode flags into an actionable\nmessage: too many codes sent, verification locked, or — when the auth\noptions carried an fsaChallenge — the hint that Apple does not send SMS\ncodes for accounts with a security key.\n\nAll user-facing auth messages are English now (the STALE_SESSION_401 and\nRATE_LIMITED prefixes main.ts matches on are unchanged).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: 