ect writes in `syncMap` now use read-merge-write (`getObject` + `setObject`) so existing ACLs and custom settings are preserved instead of being overwritten\n* (ticaki) changed: internal waits (security-key polling, PCS consent, geocoder rate-throttle) now use the cancellable adapter timer, so pending timers are cleared cleanly when the adapter unloads\n* (ticaki) changed: geocoder HTTP requests now use `AbortSignal.timeout` with improved timeout detection\n* (ticaki) fixed: addressed ioBroker repochecker findings for the latest-repo listing","tree":{"sha":"78ee39b1103aa9b23ed2ea319dfa174b8666d179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/trees/78ee39b1103aa9b23ed2ea319dfa174b8666d179"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/git/commits/b86cdcc8d3b4541d14dc2028ea107dff43f00d2c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59184294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki","id":59184294,"login":"ticaki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTg0Mjk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ticaki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ticaki/ioBroker.icloud/commit/b86cdcc8d3b4541d14dc2028ea107dff43f00d2c","node_id":"C_kwDOSDKl4NoAKGI4NmNkY2M4Z