 (layout/typography/colors/states/\n  responsive/assets/a11y), complete MCP tool reference (17 tools in 4\n  categories), skill routing table, troubleshooting section\n- code-connect.instructions.md: Added parserless template API reference\n  with correct instance.getString/getEnum/getBoolean syntax, lightweight\n  send_code_connect_mappings workflow, figma.config.json full options table\n- copilot-instructions.md: Added asset handling rules, MCP tool reference,\n  skill routing, truncated response handling\n- generate-component SKILL.md: Added asset handling, validation checklist,\n  truncated response strategy, skill boundaries\n- figma-code-connect SKILL.md: Added send_code_connect_mappings lightweight\n  approach, skill boundaries, parserless template reference\n- NEW docs/figma-for-designers.md: Designer guide for structuring Figma\n  files for MCP (components, variables, auto layout, semantic names,\n  annotations, ready-for-dev, component sets, Code Connect, assets)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"38fac1c3d345b13127c914daa7676f866a85a5c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andreadattola21-cloud/lib-figma-testing-15-aprile/git/trees/38fac1c3d345b13127c914daa7676f866a85a5c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andreadattola21-cloud/lib-figma-testing-15-aprile/git/commits/d5c6c0fd9b2a8514dbd383e94e6648bf9a8ec9e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/andreadattola21-cloud/lib-figma-testing-15-aprile/commit/d5c6c0fd9b2a8514dbd383e94e6648bf9a8ec9e8","node_id":"C_kwDOSDPuHdoAKGQ1YzZjMGZkOWIyYTg1MTRkYmQzODNlOTRlNjY0OGJmOWE4ZWM5ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andreadattola21-cloud/lib-figma-testing-15-aprile/commit/c7dc2a573aeff9ebb6e4aa6ba6fee0d60edd34e8","sha":"c7dc2a573aeff9ebb6e4aa6ba6fee0d60edd34e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andreadattola21-cloud/lib-figma-testing-1