.com/users/clicktronix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clicktronix","id":15245608,"login":"clicktronix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjQ1NjA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/commits/eca89d09007ea37037cd6173f140e0f256f007cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:50:10Z","email":"s28.morgan@gmail.com","name":"Vladislav Manakov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:50:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: keep cohesion advisory and unblock migration check records (#31)\n\n* fix(cohesion): walk shared roots, judge fixtures file by file, one finding per leaf, fail on a missing root; reconcile the docs 4.3.0 left apart\n\nFindings from the 2026-09-18 audit of #29/#30, all reproduced before fixing.\n\n- check-module-cohesion.mjs: every capability and every admitted shared root is walked; a plain\n  fixtures/ or tests/ is entered and judged file by file (data, assets, styles are production,\n  source there is test support) instead of skipped whole, so server/fixtures/seed.json no longer\n  makes server/ test-only; an empty directory is reported itself; only the deepest test-only\n  directory is reported, not every ancestor; a missing moduleRoot exits 1 instead of printing ok.\n  Validator: 3 clean runs, 7 mutations (leaf-not-ancestor, source-only fixtures, empty dir, lib\n  split, shared lib split, shared test-only, missing root).\n- Eight properties in every document that lists the floor (rules/README.md twice,\n  adoption-and-enforcement.md, ADR 0001 row 12); 4.3.0 added the eighth in one place.\n- module-cohesion.md: rsc.ts is no longer a private role inside a scenario folder and no auth\n  wrapper lives in server/**; naming rules are preferences under the contract''s \"responsibility,\n  not template\" sentence; example aligned (map-row.ts) with the contract.\n- migrating-architecture step 3 appends the checker to the target''s check command so the record\n  measures the property the CHANGELOG had claimed was mechanical.\n- client-cache.md: promotion driver restated as the two consumers rule 9 requires.\n- The 4.3.0 scenario is split into three, one reference each; evidence counts 20/15.\n\nnpm run validate: green.\n\n* fix(migration): snapshot ignored state without changing the real index\n\n* fix(cohesion): make private layout guidance advisory\n\n* fix(review): align migration prompts with advisory cohesion","tree":{"sha":"151fff3775c45ec25757a082cde475aa0619250b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/git/trees/151fff3775c45ec25757a082cde475aa0619250b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/git/commits/eca89d09007ea37037cd6173f140e0f256f007cc","verification":{"payload":"tree 151fff3775c45ec25757a082cde475aa0619250b\nparent ba897c033800547231f98ade675a3ec9f2d0d024\nauthor Vladislav Manakov <s28.morgan@gmail.com> 1790020210 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790020210 +0500\n\nfix: keep cohesion advisory and unblock migration check records (#31)\n\n* fix(cohesion): walk shared roots, judge fixtures file by file, one finding per leaf, fail on a missing root; reconcile the docs 4.3.0 left apart\n\nFindings from the 2026-09-18 audit of #29/#30, all reproduced before fixing.\n\n- check-module-cohesion.mjs: every capability and every admitted shared root is walked; a plain\n  fixtures/ or tests/ is entered and judged file by file (data, assets, styles are production,\n  source there is test support) instead of skipped whole, so server/fixtures/seed.json no longer\n  makes server/ test-only; an empty directory is reported itself; only the deepest test-only\n  directory is reported, not every ancestor; a missing moduleRoot exits 1 instead of printing ok.\n  Validator: 3 clean runs, 7 mutations (leaf-not-ancestor, source-only fixtures, empty dir, lib\n  split, shared lib split, shared test-only, missing root).\n- Eight properties in every document that lists the floor (rules/README.md twice,\n  adoption-and-enforcement.md, ADR 0001 row 12); 4.3.0 added the eighth in one place.\n- module-cohesion.md: rsc.ts is no longer a private role inside a scenario folder and no auth\n  wrapper lives in server/**; naming rules are preferences under the contract''s \"responsibility,\n  not template\" sentence; example aligned (map-row.ts) with the contract.\n- migrating-architecture step 3 appends the checker to the target''s check command so the record\n  measures the property the CHANGELOG had claimed was mechanical.\n- client-cache.md: promotion driver restated as the two consumers rule 9 requires.\n- The 4.3.0 scenario is split into three, one reference each; evidence counts 20/15.\n\nnpm run validate: green.\n\n* fix(migration): snapshot ignored state without changing the real index\n\n* fix(cohesion): make private layout guidance advisory\n\n* fix(review): align migration prompts with advisory cohesion","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsYpyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFQoQAFpqpM81OIeXjAHWz6H/2WS1\ncVStXoPl6lKLVGZBwkRu9WPkfQSHVvPNDj5E065xvNp9zW1r01NgD0zDKbgQeDwn\nb7x+I0MYtrnTaKDOET49v6HwXkSN5XUjmRBJ5PF8KMeY+pyY/Vjqj9ei7Nnhaer4\nymVSwtML5z5K6y6vtBirLdVWdsuteh9CfEo6p/euVcClr5Ki5r/+WoBs78a2YTHD\ndinu4ewvbIwDvZJpq29qmKcvtE1gpJsvmzJEuUQSa2SkiVmlS1toRR+2f9oWVJuf\nIokEKpHk/CZUAUWksPHUn1WACiQegVOHSgHgC/gsR9wVZNAcJSlOYPl1je0LM45q\nFsEbaVPUQoijsGMSrpk82sKtHQzWBz1C0plLXp4Hg+oqwQ4ZJh4wlB84DkLd7Fc5\nzXhcvnkMmqeAXYd+zZ12P1N