ublish named re-exports, and\nactions.ts is the one inversion the ''use server'' compiler constraint forces\n— and extend the migration verify.js reviewer prompt with that check plus a\ncheck for stale mock.module() paths after a move. Update CHANGELOG.md so the\n\"all cohesion properties are review-only\" claim no longer covers these two.\n\n* docs(designing-architecture): positive cohesion rule and schema kinds\n\nmodule-cohesion.md defined cohesion only by negation. Add the positive\n\"two names, two jobs\" rule from the platform''s modules.md: a scenario folder\nnames a verb+object product operation, a file names its architectural role\n(query.ts/command.ts/orchestrator.ts, data.ts/repository.ts/http.ts,\nquery.ts/mutation.ts/store.ts), flat-until-a-second-production-file promotes\nto a folder, and use-case.ts/bare adapter.ts-service.ts-manager.ts/generic\nsubject buckets are banned. Add the read-verb vocabulary (list-/read-, never\nget-/load-; authorization is a role such as rsc.ts, never a verb) and\nrestate lib.ts/lib/ as \"never both, name lib/ files by behaviour\" per finding.\n\nSplit the three schema kinds (input, record, row) into a new portable\nreference, references/outbound/schema-kinds.md, linked from both\nmodule-cohesion.md and row-vs-domain-types.md — keeping the distinction in\nmodule-cohesion.md itself blew the reference''s 2600-char budget, and the\nkinds are a portable rule on their own. This is the fix for the record/row\nconflation bug class: a read projection parsed with the input schema\nrewrote stored data and crashed on a legitimately empty stored string.\n\nAlso: client-cache.md documents the second, independent driver for\npromoting a query-key factory to root query-cache.ts (''use client'' cannot\npublish a runtime-neutral value to a server consumer, regardless of\nconsumer count); the module-internal-cohesion.json scenario gains a case\nthe reference does not literally list (list-/load- variants of the same\nread scattered across two files, one secretly meaning \"authorized\"); and\nSKILL.md links the new schema-kinds reference.\n\n* fix: preserve resource folders and distinct schema contracts\n\n* docs: align cohesion guidance with schema ownership","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq7BdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAV9YQACEClC0m5Zlo/FdgQypclzSR\naxE3i9Ar+xCPuZpK4z/hdPggJKrRBl+e1Eej/p43AfaJkgAljQzxlFqMn7LyVZ7e\nuBD2uIIb9qMlHe4W4BijfEcQNKOqggTxWjba8AEVd5UE4vKQo5NYnz+sKuePXy6L\nLABj9qOOs13gu8n74xuv7jHzpZ+ryGvc/S2ljCAdGIOa25k/wr+jHaCjJ6vuVZUR\n+ES7SIBid0dpQx4XlbHt5BFKO7XGx0WcIOmh6Q78aSVOEmWBh8p8TVvQbKlBOB4h\nsv0MTxYKIev+VTMuyRw4OlsNdUgm2rCpSaCwISKuaE+REuRn36WtLJzdVgnGn3Pw\nrvjjopv0maC9p1qPIf94o+t4S8NZEaRC3QgLi5ytqjxg/54O8FTupvFRQ1/jRaJu\neuIJpoGdUq1ieuD7pDn1MmcLIdlinRsin3RMJJkDDlxAdZAihdOJqThIq1BfqbDu\n5x8xwQPKr9YCg0685YwO74UQgID2MeL+R5ezdvEfJhssanBE7QvP2tGLme2zqzYT\n3e3nwPkGpHHwtntYrmitZ7XVjs78G7a6JF0CFBMOGTnQZjcb81G8QHy5I5LyQXuD\nx/Q5vBSboEK7Bwl5uXlljYRmvIXuvhAw3JX78NoAr0owx3wOP3YypBQQtGXls0OQ\nUGCWR4lLmEAFCkPUf5BQ\n=j6pu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T09:18:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","