 the rule sections almost item for item —\nseven of eight in the architecture skill, all seven in the component skill.\nCurrent models self-verify, so the third copy of each rule spent always-on\ncontext and pushed the model into re-checking rather than adding coverage.\n\nSix recorded GREEN scenario cells are invalidated by these edits. The\ncontent-hash guard caught them; their observations are retained under\ngreen_check_invalidated and the coverage table reports them as rerun-pending.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: skills renamed from nextjs-architecture to\ndesigning-nextjs-capabilities and from react-component-creator to\ncreating-react-components. Frozen eval artifacts keep the old names: the\ncontrol arms archive paths from refs that predate the rename, and the\ncandidate and opus5-gates directories are hashed snapshots.","tree":{"sha":"98cbf2b167601032021e752add22f9725f57fbfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/git/trees/98cbf2b167601032021e752add22f9725f57fbfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/git/commits/fd8cb8fabeff99c1148bccf50cb97215a8b92047","verification":{"payload":"tree 98cbf2b167601032021e752add22f9725f57fbfe\nparent 32ec3d7490e99fc012cb19c16c141e1c040a30ac\nauthor Vladislav Manakov <s28.morgan@gmail.com> 1785407019 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785407019 +0500\n\nrefactor!: align skills with Opus 5 and skill-authoring guidance (#16)\n\nRemove the closing verification gate from both skills, rename them to the\ngerund form the authoring guidance recommends, and flatten one reference\nchain. Adds a two-arm Claude Opus 5 A/B runner and records its result.\n\nThe verification gates restated the rule sections almost item for item —\nseven of eight in the architecture skill, all seven in the component skill.\nCurrent models self-verify, so the third copy of each rule spent always-on\ncontext and pushed the model into re-checking rather than adding coverage.\n\nSix recorded GREEN scenario cells are invalidated by these edits. The\ncontent-hash guard caught them; their observations are retained under\ngreen_check_invalidated and the coverage table reports them as rerun-pending.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: skills renamed from nextjs-architecture to\ndesigning-nextjs-capabilities and from react-component-creator to\ncreating-react-components. Frozen eval artifacts keep the old names: the\ncontrol arms archive paths from refs that predate the rename, and the\ncandidate and opus5-gates directories are hashed snapshots.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqayYrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeWcQAFHq3Ayqi+wyoDKUrZatI65U\nJDqq1vnMseznDV8ew7sxe456gski3ZdJZ0oOtRoggCZguXgls1+8N+nnatrKSt2X\nAPJkPMqt7JPyyx4UTzUCoZ7vWibeKtBmwOVMtSEl8BQ9HbrXlxxpA4uSoDEHGIDj\nHjuhaykTM56pHeNgPpSxmQPx8jI+vhTwdhoEOQ2jR724xsDQGbLPL5yZmDtt/Sbj\nNebb+MvILqL5PJX45BE3qdjF5fraD5sd8nf94zpCjuey5rCRnfi8IQaHJ6uE1hwm\nasRA5tK1JNG3VcFeucL1s8aMKZRsM43rQQGuhQ4V+cz4dKbkYxkpNB5iyp/z6Btb\nAw/5qhGfusCDXapbslQfaOLJpbTwmXzXwtaXLu7KNpnMR9kIWQgvpzX3oOqo8tkX\no6Tuh1tS95WocRwUQbh+cDYLQwGuqFtwsa/4jOQzYgMHiSKHHk2bO0rJgAGac8H1\nyUDeNla1di14OmLamo6aYfie9FHf/xghgBFxdnBCSwuvv26bUHFoJ2d/sVj67nYU\niOQlMEtaOFTZls9jX/OKkTfJPavn6uq9spZFqqlgrNAy7qq02QFKshBQ9VC6Tgz4\n9PWSokjhL4N0QIeAftRyCBgZ29z7vJkov8eN+ZVhgdGUK0Cm+5xJH5QyU2doECE1\n8zJHu2EMFw6QuocWPTGA\n=OJ8l\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-30T10:23:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","recei