of waiting for an audit.\n- state-placement.md duplicated the SKILL.md State Placement table and had\n  already drifted (Zustand row). The SKILL.md table is now canonical; the\n  reference keeps only the escalation nuance (its unique ''target repo\n  includes it and the need is measured'' clause folded into the prose) and\n  the Explicit Variants section (anchor untouched - scenario still resolves).\n- notifications-and-feedback.md linked reference->reference across skills\n  (a depth-2 hop per best-practices); the ApiError prerequisite is now\n  stated inline with a by-name pointer.\n- tests/scenarios/README.md: explicit eval-coverage map - 3 references\n  eval-proven, 1 merged, 11 untested, 1 n/a - so untested guidance is\n  visible instead of implied-covered.","tree":{"sha":"66a15306dc717470fe777a88821a1756e3e6314f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/git/trees/66a15306dc717470fe777a88821a1756e3e6314f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/git/commits/8dd4e0453773e5a0261a67d87078687616642493","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/commit/8dd4e0453773e5a0261a67d87078687616642493","node_id":"C_kwDOSDZWYNoAKDhkZDRlMDQ1Mzc3M2U1YTAyNjFhNjdkODcwNzg2ODc2MTY2NDI0OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/commit/3588d431a24eefb22562334ebd2a61643a430328","sha":"3588d431a24eefb22562334ebd2a61643a430328","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/commits/3588d431a24eefb22562334ebd2a61643a430328"}],"sha":"8dd4e0453773e5a0261a67d87078687616642493","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/commits/8dd4e0453773e5a0261a67d87078687616642493"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15245608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix/events{/privac