fixes\nrefactor — covering data ownership, security, persistence, observability,\ncomponent composition, and feedback UX.\n\nnextjs-architecture:\n- RSC + DAL hybrid read (initialData + initialDataUpdatedAt: 0)\n- Server action input parsing + length caps\n- Defense-in-depth ownership filter\n- Bulk RPC via jsonb_to_recordset\n- Postgres error -> typed ApiError mapping\n- Explicit column selection rule\n- New reference: observability-and-sentry.md\n\nreact-component-creator:\n- Compound provider split (state vs actions, per-slice memo deps)\n- Explicit variants vs mode discriminator + Frame/Slot pattern\n- Localized Standard Schema -> Mantine validator bridge\n- New reference: notifications-and-feedback.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fd5cf2f7c9b20447ffa89bd9818d1aa08aa3dbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/git/trees/7fd5cf2f7c9b20447ffa89bd9818d1aa08aa3dbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/git/commits/8a680b9e8a49046bbfffa45f491c455685464b82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/commit/8a680b9e8a49046bbfffa45f491c455685464b82","node_id":"C_kwDOSDZWYNoAKDhhNjgwYjllOGE0OTA0NmJiZmZmYTQ1ZjQ5MWM0NTU2ODU0NjRiODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/commit/659e7f27c165d2485c48dd4935b57a2c643b8020","sha":"659e7f27c165d2485c48dd4935b57a2c643b8020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/commits/659e7f27c165d2485c48dd4935b57a2c643b8020"}],"sha":"8a680b9e8a49046bbfffa45f491c455685464b82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/commits/8a680b9e8a49046bbfffa45f491c455685464b82"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15245608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix