3045f5794501cc7fe9c4ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T17:04:20Z","email":"s28.morgan@gmail.com","name":"Clicktronix"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T17:04:20Z","email":"s28.morgan@gmail.com","name":"Clicktronix"},"message":"Consolidate into single react-clean-skills plugin; expand skills with glossary, auth, forms, testing, anti-patterns\n\narchitector:\n- add Glossary (port, adapter, use-case, inbound, actions.ts)\n- add Auth Context section (withAdminAuthContext, requireAuth helpers)\n- add Cache Revalidation pattern with revalidatePath helper\n- add Feature-Local Actions boundary example\n- add per-layer testing patterns (domain, use-case with fake port, server-state hook)\n- add Anti-Patterns block\n\ncomponent-creator:\n- add State Placement Decision Tree (server/form/page UI/global/local)\n- add _internal/ segment convention\n- add full Mantine Form + Valibot example with createMantineValidator\n- add Loading & Error States patterns (Skeleton, Loader, Alert, ErrorBoundary)\n- add Styling Alternatives hierarchy (Mantine props → layout → CSS Modules → palette)","tree":{"sha":"86c4329344ca6099a2a7f59b56e9262a856abba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/git/trees/86c4329344ca6099a2a7f59b56e9262a856abba7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clicktronix/nextjs-clean-skills/git/commits/820312f72affc28dd43045f5794501cc7fe9c4ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15245608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clicktronix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clicktronix","id":15245608,"login":"clicktronix","n