ZmFlMmUxMTI4OGU1MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commit/7d7b86771c5f5b82c9ea361e009012562e93ca27","sha":"7d7b86771c5f5b82c9ea361e009012562e93ca27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/7d7b86771c5f5b82c9ea361e009012562e93ca27"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commit/2947d2b6c786f75b1ce712e7d389a1b07b098a40","sha":"2947d2b6c786f75b1ce712e7d389a1b07b098a40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/2947d2b6c786f75b1ce712e7d389a1b07b098a40"}],"sha":"8084b475c7d6bd1d8967091354fae2e11288e506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/8084b475c7d6bd1d8967091354fae2e11288e506"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206593359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov","id":206593359,"login":"TalGershanov","node_id":"U_kgDODFBdTw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/2947d2b6c786f75b1ce712e7d389a1b07b098a40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T15:06:36Z","email":"talgershanov@gmail.com","name":"Tal Gershanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T15:06:36Z","email":"talgershanov@gmail.com","name":"Tal Gershanov"},"message":"Fix /translate silently dropping terms that /analyse detected correctly\n\nreplace_terms() independently re-searched the raw text for each term''s\ncanonical term_name via regex, instead of trusting the exact span\ndetection already found. That silently dropped a term whenever the\nmatched text didn''t literally equal the DB''s canonical name -- e.g. a\nHebrew prefix fused onto the term (\"בלחץ דם גבוה\"), or an English term\nwhose Hebrew term_name got looked up because the whole document was\nclassified \"he\" (e.g. \"Hepatitis B\" -> \"דלקת כבד B\").\n\nReplace ClinicalTranslator''s regex re-search with apply_translations(),\nwhich splices each approved term''s explanation directly at the span\n/analyse already found (detect_terms_with_explanations now also exposes\nterm_name). No independent re-search, no possibility of a name mismatch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0487493d4bc99931256e8a4529acb219a3fff16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/git/trees/f0487493d4bc99931256e8a4529acb219a3fff16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/git/commits/2947d2b6c786f75b1ce712e7d389a1b07b098a40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206593359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov","id":206593359,"login":"TalGershanov","node_id":"U_kgDODFBdTw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commit/2947d2b6c786f75b1ce712e7d389a1b07b098a40","node_id":"C_kwDOSDc3rtoAKDI5NDdkMmI2Yzc4NmY3NWIxY2U3MTJlN2QzODlhMWIwN2IwOThhNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commit/d29c87484519a616316ecb04e2cb6d4ab1b2f43a","sha":"d29c87484519a616316ecb04e2cb6d4ab1b2f43a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/d29c87484519a616316ecb04e2cb6d4ab1b2f43a"}],"sha":"2947d2b6c786f75b1ce712e7d389a1b07b098a40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/2947d2b6c786f75b1ce712e7d389a1b07b098a40"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206593359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov","id":206593359,"login":"TalGershanov","node_id":"U_kgDODFBdTw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/d29c87484519a616316ecb04e2cb6d4ab1b2f43a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T14:38:30Z","email":"talgershanov@gmail.com","name":"Tal Gershanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T14:38:30Z","email":"talgershanov@gmail.com","name":"Tal Gershanov"},"message":"Fix Hebrew explanation language and formatting, truncate scraped text to intro section\n\n- /analyse and /translate now surface simple_explanation (the genuine\n  scraped Hebrew text) instead of short_explanation (an untranslated\n  English placeholder) when the request is in Hebrew.\n- Add dir=\"auto\" across both frontends so mixed Hebrew/English text\n  renders with correct bidi direction instead of broken/reordered lines.\n- Rework the infomed.co.il scraper''s _extract_body_text to stop at the\n  first embedded photo, keeping only the article''s intro section instead\n  of the entire page body, and make the DB write path an upsert so\n  re-scraping can actually replace previously-captured text. Re-scraped\n  and re-populated all 413 Hebrew concepts with the corrected extraction.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0fcd43846dcb92bcb699b301a74dca610f1efa8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/git/trees/0fcd43846dcb92bcb699b301a74dca610f1efa8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/git/commits/d29c87484519a616316ecb04e2cb6d4ab1b2f43a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206593359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov","id":20