:"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov","id":206593359,"login":"TalGershanov","node_id":"U_kgDODFBdTw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commit/b35f37beb87947d8a130cf93ca1893e54f9d5aba","node_id":"C_kwDOSDc3rtoAKGIzNWYzN2JlYjg3OTQ3ZDhhMTMwY2Y5M2NhMTg5M2U1NGY5ZDVhYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commit/b9905d1fc98fc91b05ada8419d99b1688f0a6cdf","sha":"b9905d1fc98fc91b05ada8419d99b1688f0a6cdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/b9905d1fc98fc91b05ada8419d99b1688f0a6cdf"}],"sha":"b35f37beb87947d8a130cf93ca1893e54f9d5aba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/b35f37beb87947d8a130cf93ca1893e54f9d5aba"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/375548e8522193a5511d9f6f02d421b1d26b47f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:32:57Z","email":"yuvalbashan7@gmail.com","name":"yuvalbashan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:32:57Z","email":"yuvalbashan7@gmail.com","name":"yuvalbashan"},"message":"Replace mechanical term replacement with a constrained OpenAI rewrite\n\nlogic/translator.py: add simplify_text_with_openai(), which rewrites the\noriginal text using only the explanations explicitly supplied in\nexplanation_map, and remove ClinicalTranslator.replace_terms()''s mechanical\n\"term (explanation)\" substitution. The rewrite system prompt explicitly\nforbids explaining any term absent from explanation_map, whether detected-\nbut-unselected or undetected entirely, verified against live end-to-end\ntesting on the real trie/DB/OpenAI pipeline.\n\nserver/api.py: /translate now builds explanation_map via\ndetect_terms_with_explanations() filtered to ui_selection-approved terms,\nthen calls simplify_text_with_openai() instead of the old mechanical\nreplacement.\n\nDAL/interface.py, DAL/db.py: dict | None -> Optional[dict] so the DAL can\nimport on Python 3.9 (PEP 604 union syntax requires 3.10+); no behavior\nchange.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"282f4062ad7b91ef99c81f435a764acd36fad803","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/git/trees/282f4062ad7b91ef99c81f435a764acd36fad803"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/git/commits/375548e8522193a5511d9f6f02d421b1d26b47f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commit/375548e8522193a5511d9f6f02d421b1d26b47f8","node_id":"C_kwDOSDc3rtoAKDM3NTU0OGU4NTIyMTkzYTU1MTFkOWY2ZjAyZDQyMWIxZDI2YjQ3Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commit/821807e1ad929592d4ec742dd5d349e23a4183cc","sha":"821807e1ad929592d4ec742dd5d349e23a4183cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/821807e1ad929592d4ec742dd5d349e23a4183cc"}],"sha":"375548e8522193a5511d9f6f02d421b1d26b47f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/375548e8522193a5511d9f6f02d421b1d26b47f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206593359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://