nize fine-tuning work into finetuning/ and add Experiment 2 results\n\nConsolidates the annotation/ and fine_tuning/ directories into a single\nfinetuning/ tree with shared code, per-experiment scripts/data/results/review/\ndeployment folders, and a README documenting the pipeline. Renames Experiment\n2''s evaluation artifacts to evaluation_initial.* (historical) and\nevaluation_final.* (canonical, json_schema-based, 0 format failures), and\nupdates compare_experiments_final.py to read the canonical run. Removes one\nsuperseded, never-executed duplicate script and one fully-reproducible\nintermediate file; preserves all manual annotations, review sheets, and\ntraining/eval artifacts for both experiments.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50c73fa3cbacb6ace4e012fd61ff8b9e3c608cb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/git/trees/50c73fa3cbacb6ace4e012fd61ff8b9e3c608cb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/git/commits/e31528f0f2a0a3a9595e4939ea4859822631362b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commit/e31528f0f2a0a3a9595e4939ea4859822631362b","node_id":"C_kwDOSDc3rtoAKGUzMTUyOGYwZjJhMGEzYTk1OTVlNDkzOWVhNDg1OTgyMjYzMTM2MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commit/22bbf6fee4f01693f9bb182aa58a5c9385c3718b","sha":"22bbf6fee4f01693f9bb182aa58a5c9385c3718b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/22bbf6fee4f01693f9bb182aa58a5c9385c3718b"}],"sha":"e31528f0f2a0a3a9595e4939ea4859822631362b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/e31528f0f2a0a3a9595e4939ea4859822631362b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206593359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGersh