r","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/commits/8d009bd41ffc47fe444e8aad341b82ad4d20f475/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:42:04Z","email":"talgershanov@gmail.com","name":"Tal Gershanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:42:04Z","email":"talgershanov@gmail.com","name":"Tal Gershanov"},"message":"Fix deploy workflow killing itself instead of uvicorn\n\npkill -f matches the full command line of every process, including the\ndeploy script''s own shell (its argv literally contains the text\n\"uvicorn ...\" from later in the script), so it was sending SIGTERM to\nitself before ever reaching the nohup line. Dropping -f matches only\nthe process name, which is \"bash\" for the script and \"uvicorn\" for the\nactual server process.","tree":{"sha":"bd224834a9e8f90532c26f6fc4689c1eddb54f30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/git/trees/bd224834a9e8f90532c26f6fc4689c1eddb54f30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TalGershanov/ClearMed/git/commits/8d009bd41ffc47fe444e8aad341b82ad4d20f475","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206593359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TalGershanov","id":206593359,"login":"TalGershanov","node_id":"U_kgDODFBdTw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TalGershanov/repos","site_admin":fa