g4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/b02b5afaa241ab1bc716ee6294d63e305e17778b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T07:06:04Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T07:06:04Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"chore: make repo public-ready with CI/CD, governance, and contribution setup\n\nGovernance:\n- LICENSE: GPL v3\n- CONTRIBUTING.md: dev setup, PR process, commit convention, code style,\n  template dev guidelines, translation requirements\n- CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md: Contributor Covenant v2.1\n- SECURITY.md: vulnerability reporting via GitHub Security Advisories\n- CHANGELOG.md: v0.1.0 with all features listed\n\nCI/CD:\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: lint (ruff) + typecheck (mypy) + test (pytest)\n  on every PR, Python 3.11/3.12 matrix\n- .github/workflows/release.yml: build + GitHub Release on tag push\n- .github/pull_request_template.md: PR checklist\n- .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/: bug report, feature request, config\n\nDeveloper experience:\n- Makefile: install, test, lint, typecheck, format, ci, clean\n- .pre-commit-config.yaml: ruff + trailing whitespace + yaml/json checks\n- Fixed all ruff lint errors (unused variables)\n- Added types-PyYAML to dev dependencies for mypy","tree":{"sha":"8fee45ca4b8aa94e6a1264b14957c1e7cbf3aa95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/8fee45ca4b8aa94e6a1264b14957c1e7cbf3aa95"},"url":"https://ap