ent_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T06:09:11Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"feat: complete ui-kit with all essential components, stories, charts, and dashboard page type\n\nNew components (4):\n  DropdownMenu — click-based dropdown with items, separators, labels\n  Sheet — slide-in panel from any edge with overlay\n  Breadcrumb — navigation trail with separator\n  Pagination — page navigation with prev/next/numbers/ellipsis\n\nStorybook stories (12 new files, 23 total):\n  Form: Checkbox, Textarea, Switch\n  Display: Avatar, Separator, Skeleton, Progress, Tooltip\n  Layout: ScrollArea\n  Feedback: Toast\n  Navigation: DropdownMenu, Breadcrumb, Pagination, Sheet\n  Charts: BarChart, LineChart, PieChart, AreaChart (with mock data)\n\nDashboard page type:\n  pages with type=''dashboard'' generate stat cards + bar chart + recent items table\n  Chart auto-picks first numeric field for values, first string field for grouping\n  Works with and without ui-kit (plain HTML fallback)","tree":{"sha":"9d92223fc9183ae7fd21d4618917743f5bd0d471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/9d92223fc9183ae7fd21d4618917743f5bd0d471"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/commits/e57314164d8c85f953c1ca767d5778bdfc846745","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/or