rted.md  - step-by-step tutorial (all templates)\n  resources-and-crud.md - resource config, field types, generated code\n  multi-tenancy.md    - 7-layer tenant isolation flow\n  api-client-and-types.md - typed client, TS generation, sync command\n  security.md         - headers, CORS, OAuth2, DevSecurityConfig\n  observability.md    - correlation IDs, structured logging\n  testing.md          - Testcontainers, integration tests, pytest\n  deployment.md       - Docker Compose, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions\n\nCreated missing api-client template README.\nUpdated all 6 template READMEs with new features:\n  api-domain: resources, Hibernate filter, Testcontainers, correlation ID\n  api-gateway: CorrelationIdFilter, SecurityHeadersFilter, DevSecurityConfig\n  platform-shell: ShellContextSync, ErrorBoundary, ToastProvider, security headers\n  frontend-app: data-aware pages, resource+type, TypeScript types\n  ui-kit: Toast/Toaster components","tree":{"sha":"05c007d8671bda59d41f3788afb751adcfad7ec5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/05c007d8671bda59d41f3788afb751adcfad7ec5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/commits/40878e8282b1f88c40120cbe9458b52605a8d059","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received