ithub.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/f0a13affa7ac27c6e4dd21081739fc9b056b937c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:55:34Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:55:34Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"feat: generate Testcontainers integration tests per resource\n\nEach generated resource now includes a full integration test that:\n- Starts a real PostgreSQL via Testcontainers\n- Tests the complete CRUD lifecycle (create/read/list/update/delete)\n- Verifies tenant isolation (tenant-A data invisible to tenant-B)\n- Tests validation (POST with missing required field returns 400)\n- Tests not found (GET with bad ID returns 404)\n\nInfrastructure:\n- AbstractIntegrationTest base class with PostgreSQLContainer,\n  DynamicPropertySource, MockMvc, and test profile\n- application-test.yaml for test configuration\n- Testcontainers + json-path dependencies in build.gradle.kts\n- Tests use properly escaped JSON for Java string literals","tree":{"sha":"9163562c633ff893d92e4d9220c8c803bbcf1f2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/9163562c633ff893d92e4d9220c8c803bbcf1f2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/commits/f0a13affa7ac27c6e4dd21081739fc9b056b937c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/f0a13affa7ac27c6e4dd21081739fc9b056b937c","node_id":"C_kwDOSDgQ39oAKGYwYTEzYWZmYTdhYzI3YzZlNGRkMjEwODE3MzlmYzliMDU2YjkzN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/05f9684f725a12cff019892993ebb5a0b7678599","sha":"05f9684f725a12cff019892993ebb5a0b7678599","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/05f9684f725a12cff019892993ebb5a0b7678599"}],"sha":"f0a13affa7ac27c6e4dd21081739fc9b056b937c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/f0a13affa7ac27c6e4dd21081739fc9b056b937c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/05f9684f725a12cff019892993ebb5a0b7678599/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:49:09Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:49:09Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"feat: error boundary + toast system (ui-kit aware)\n\nErrorBoundary (always included in shell):\n- React class component wrapping MFE loading\n- Catches render crashes, shows recovery UI with ''Try again'' button\n- Uses theme CSS variables (destructive, primary, muted-foreground)\n\nToastProvider (generated by CLI, picks version based on --uikit):\n- With --uikit: imports Toaster/useToast from the ui-kit package\n  (full shadcn toast with animations, variants, dismiss)\n- Without --uikit: self-contained lightweight toast using Tailwind\n  (portal-based, auto-dismiss, same variant API)\n- Both expose useToast() hook with toast({ description, variant })\n\nui-kit additions:\n- Toast component (shadcn-style with cva variants: default/destructive/success)\n- Toaster container (context + portal, auto-dismiss, close button)\n- Exported from ui-kit index.ts\n\nShell main.tsx wires ErrorBoundary around RouterProvider.\ngenerate.py calls generate_toast_provider() after uikit linking.","tree":{"sha":"82efb8c160304ada3ca9520f7eb4c32b2427e3de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/82efb8c160304ada3ca9520f7eb4c32b2427e3de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/commits/05f9684f725a12cff019892993ebb5a0b7678599","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/05f9684f725a12cff019892993ebb5a0b7678599","node_id":"C_kwDOSDgQ39oAKDA1Zjk2ODRmNzI1YTEyY2ZmMDE5ODkyOTkzZWJiNWEwYjc2Nzg1OTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/d98400bf0f8d5b8ccb9e50b62ba54e92232d8ff8","sha":"d98400bf0f8d5b8ccb9e50b62ba54e92232d8ff8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/d98400bf0f8d5b8ccb9e50b62ba54e92232d8ff8"}],"sha":"05f9684f725a12cff019892993ebb5a0b7678599","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/05f9684f725a12cff019892993ebb5a0b7678599"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/d98400bf0f8d5b8ccb9e50b62ba54e92232d8ff8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:38:18Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:38:18Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"feat: security headers on shell nginx, MFE nginx, and gateway\n\nShell nginx: X-Frame-Options DENY, X-Content-Type-Options nosniff,\n  Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, Content-Security-Policy with\n  frame-ancestors none and Clerk domains whitelisted for connect-src.\n\nFrontend-app nginx: X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy\n  (no CSP/X-Frame-Options since MFEs are loaded cross-origin by shell).\n\nGateway: SecurityHeadersFilter adds X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options,\n  Referrer-Policy, Cache-Control no-store to all API responses.","tree":{"sha":"ecdc9b2c9187b91f30ef968401edb1274767ece6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/ecdc9b2c9187b91f30ef968401edb1274767ece6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/commits/d98400bf0f8d5b8ccb9e50b62ba54e92232d8ff8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/d98400bf0f8d5b8ccb9e50b62ba54e92232d8ff8","node_id":"C_kwDOSDgQ39oAKGQ5ODQwMGJmMGY4ZDViOGNjYjllNTBiNjJiYTU0ZTkyMjMyZDhmZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/1d2cfd8fea705336923c195f258502c13e715af4","sha":"1d2cfd8fea705336923c195f258502c13e715af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/1d2cfd8fea705336923c195f258502c13e715af4"}],"sha":"d98400bf0f8d5b8ccb9e50b62ba54e92232d8ff8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/d98400bf0f8d5b8ccb9e50b62ba54e92232d8ff8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/1d2cfd8fea705336923c195f258502c13e715af4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:36:07Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:36:07Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"feat: correlation ID tracing across gateway, backend, and frontend\n\nEvery request now gets a unique X-Correlation-ID that flows through\nthe entire stack for end-to-end request tracing.\n\nGateway (CorrelationIdFilter):\n- Generates UUID if no X-Correlation-ID header present\n- Forwards it to downstream services\n- Returns it in the response header\n- Adds to MDC for logging\n\nBackend (WebConfig):\n- Extracts X-Correlation-ID from incoming request\n- Adds to MDC (appears in every log line)\n- GlobalExceptionHandler includes correlationId in error responses\n\nFrontend (api-client):\n- Generates correlation ID on every API request\n- Attaches as X-Correlation-ID header\n- ApiError includes correlationId for error reporting\n\nShell (nginx):\n- Passes X-Correlation-ID through to the gateway\n\nLogging pattern: [correlationId] [tenantId] in both gateway and backend","tree":{"sha":"8aa7f457c5f3abb58172bfe044f7861bf4585b04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/8aa7f457c5f3abb58172bfe044f7861bf4585b04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/commits/1d2cfd8fea705336923c195f258502c13e715af4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/1d2cfd8fea705336923c195f258502c13e715af4","node_id":"C_kwDOSDgQ39oAKDFkMmNmZDhmZWE3MDUzMzY5MjNjMTk1ZjI1ODUwMmMxM2U3MTVhZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/60b08828ce749c09c86eab7e79bc09aecbc60c43","sha":"60b08828ce749c09c86eab7e79bc09aecbc60c43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/60b08828ce749c09c86eab7e79bc09aecbc60c43"}],"sha":"1d2cfd8fea705336923c195f258502c13e715af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/1d2cfd8fea705336923c195f258502c13e715af4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/60b08828ce749c09c86eab7e79bc09aecbc60c43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:30:01Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:30:01Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"feat: ORM-level tenant isolation via Hibernate @Filter\n\nTenant isolation is now enforced at the Hibernate level, not just\nat the service/repository layer. Every query on entities that extend\nTenantAwareEntity automatically gets WHERE tenant_id = :tenantId.\n\n- TenantAwareEntity: MappedSuperclass with FilterDef + Filter\n- TenantFilterInterceptor: enables Hibernate filter per-request\n- WebConfig: registers the interceptor in Spring MVC\n- Generated entities extend TenantAwareEntity (id, tenantId, timestamps)\n- Service layer uses findAll(pageable) for list, auto-scoped by filter","tree":{"sha":"cbd2a4dd8e6adefbfac08266e3698c830fd77a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/cbd2a4dd8e6adefbfac08266e3698c830fd77a00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/commits/60b08828ce749c09c86eab7e79bc09aecbc60c43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/60b08828ce749c09c86eab7e79bc09aecbc60c43","node_id":"C_kwDOSDgQ39oAKDYwYjA4ODI4Y2U3NDljMDljODZlYWI3ZTc5YmMwOWFlY2JjNjBjNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/300c1fca3f7240d85829329297ff0c2d63235348","sha":"300c1fca3f7240d85829329297ff0c2d63235348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/300c1fca3f7240d85829329297ff0c2d63235348"}],"sha":"60b08828ce749c09c86eab7e79bc09aecbc60c43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/60b08828ce749c09c86eab7e79bc09aecbc60c43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/300c1fca3f7240d85829329297ff0c2d63235348/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:23:25Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T20:23:25Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"fix: resolve 5 issues found during full-stack generation\n\n1. Nested page paths (e.g. dogs/new) crashed the page generator\n   because pascal_case did not handle slashes. Now replaces / with -\n   before conversion.\n\n2. Missing .dockerignore in frontend-app and platform-shell templates\n   caused Docker builds to fail when host node_modules existed.\n\n3. Gateway route predicate used Path=/api/{serviceName}/** but\n   controllers are at /{resourceName}, so requests never matched.\n   Changed to Path=/api/** for single-backend projects.\n\n4. OAuth2 security had no dev escape hatch - added DevSecurityConfig\n   with @Profile(local) that permits all requests, and gated the\n   production SecurityConfig behind @Profile(!local). Removed\n   broken OIDC issuer from application-local.yaml.\n\n5. Improved --gateway error message to hint that it should be used\n   when generating the backend, not the frontend.","tree":{"sha":"29ca0e5d58b440510069d11c8e1f3a6d45abadbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/29ca0e5d58b440510069d11c8e1f3a6d45abadbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/commits/300c1fca3f7240d85829329297ff0c2d63235348","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/300c1fca3f7240d85829329297ff0c2d63235348","node_id":"C_kwDOSDgQ39oAKDMwMGMxZmNhM2Y3MjQwZDg1ODI5MzI5Mjk3ZmYwYzJkNjMyMzUzNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/6ea5c8aeb3ce34836389600aa48405da84a88dc2","sha":"6ea5c8aeb3ce34836389600aa48405da84a88dc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/6ea5c8aeb3ce34836389600aa48405da84a88dc2"}],"sha":"300c1fca3f7240d85829329297ff0c2d63235348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/300c1fca3f7240d85829329297ff0c2d63235348"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/6ea5c8aeb3ce34836389600aa48405da84a88dc2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:55:26Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:55:26Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"test: add 41 tests for resources, types, pages, gateway, linking, and e2e\n\nCoverage expanded from 22 to 63 tests:\n\ntest_resources.py (14 tests):\n  - Resource JSON parsing (valid, empty, invalid, multiple)\n  - Java entity with tenant isolation (tenantId, audit fields)\n  - Repository with tenant-scoped queries\n  - Service using TenantContext\n  - Controller with full CRUD endpoints\n  - DTOs with Bean Validation annotations\n  - Liquibase migration + master changelog update\n  - All field types (string, text, int, long, decimal, boolean, date, datetime)\n  - Multiple resources with sequential migrations\n  - Shared infrastructure always generated (TenantContext, GlobalExceptionHandler)\n\ntest_types_and_pages.py (9 tests):\n  - TypeScript type generation (files, content, barrel exports, index.ts update)\n  - All TS field type mappings (required vs optional)\n  - List page with useApiClient + useQuery + table + pagination\n  - Form page with useMutation + typed inputs + validation\n  - Placeholder pages without resource stay simple\n  - Mixed page types in registry\n\ntest_gateway_and_linking.py (11 tests):\n  - Gateway route registration (single, multiple, duplicate skip)\n  - API prefix derivation from service name\n  - SecurityConfig conditional on oauth2 feature\n  - API client dependency linking + local-deps copy\n  - Docker compose project scanning\n  - Docker compose env variable substitution\n  - Docker compose GATEWAY_URL for shell\n\ntest_e2e_generation.py (3 tests):\n  - Full-stack generation (gateway + backend CRUD + shell + MFE data pages)\n  - Backend without resources still works\n  - Frontend without api-client still works","tree":{"sha":"d22701fea1926c49c80a60d76419b9e0b0a5362a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/d22701fea1926c49c80a60d76419b9e0b0a5362a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/commits/6ea5c8aeb3ce34836389600aa48405da84a88dc2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/6ea5c8aeb3ce34836389600aa48405da84a88dc2","node_id":"C_kwDOSDgQ39oAKDZlYTVjOGFlYjNjZTM0ODM2Mzg5NjAwYWE0ODQwNWRhODRhODhkYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/08541273e76b00f4d0c8a9257f46885f0a5580bd","sha":"08541273e76b00f4d0c8a9257f46885f0a5580bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/08541273e76b00f4d0c8a9257f46885f0a5580bd"}],"sha":"6ea5c8aeb3ce34836389600aa48405da84a88dc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/6ea5c8aeb3ce34836389600aa48405da84a88dc2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/08541273e76b00f4d0c8a9257f46885f0a5580bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:30:01Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:30:01Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"refactor: split large CLI files into focused generators/ package\n\ngenerate.py (881→194 lines) now contains only the CLI command.\nresources.py (799 lines) split into 4 focused modules.\n\nNew structure:\n  cli/generators/resources.py  — Java CRUD code generation\n  cli/generators/types.py      — TypeScript type generation\n  cli/generators/migrations.py — Liquibase migration generation\n  cli/generators/pages.py      — Frontend page components\n  cli/generators/shell.py      — Shell linking (remotes.json)\n  cli/generators/gateway.py    — Gateway route registration\n  cli/generators/linking.py    — Dependency linking (uikit, api-client)","tree":{"sha":"ccb334e5c4275c1b0e29202b2343d838964bd333","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/ccb334e5c4275c1b0e29202b2343d838964bd333"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/commits/08541273e76b00f4d0c8a9257f46885f0a5580bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/08541273e76b00f4d0c8a9257f46885f0a5580bd","node_id":"C_kwDOSDgQ39oAKDA4NTQxMjczZTc2YjAwZjRkMGM4YTkyNTdmNDY4ODVmMGE1NTgwYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/e33c0831c9a3c2220805c3ab9478164ae3e111b7","sha":"e33c0831c9a3c2220805c3ab9478164ae3e111b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/e33c0831c9a3c2220805c3ab9478164ae3e111b7"}],"sha":"08541273e76b00f4d0c8a9257f46885f0a5580bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/08541273e76b00f4d0c8a9257f46885f0a5580bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/e33c0831c9a3c2220805c3ab9478164ae3e111b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:21:28Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:21:28Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"feat: full-stack CRUD scaffolding from resource definitions\n\nGenerate complete backend CRUD + typed API client + data-aware frontend\npages from a single resource JSON config passed to the CLI.\n\nBackend (api-domain --resources):\n- JPA entity with tenant isolation (tenantId column on every table)\n- Spring Data repository with tenant-scoped queries\n- Service layer with CRUD operations via TenantContext\n- REST controller with list/get/create/update/delete endpoints\n- Request/response DTOs with Bean Validation constraints\n- Liquibase migration (create table + tenant index + unique constraints)\n- GlobalExceptionHandler for structured error responses\n- TenantContext for request-scoped tenant ID access\n\nTypeScript types (api-domain --api-client):\n- Generates typed interfaces (Entity, CreateRequest, UpdateRequest, PageResponse)\n- Written to api-client src/resources/ and exported from index.ts\n- Shared by all MFE consumers via the api-client package\n\nFrontend pages (frontend-app --pages with resource+type):\n- List page: useApiClient + useQuery, table, pagination, loading/error/empty states\n- Form page: useApiClient + useMutation, typed inputs, validation, success feedback\n\nSync command (appgen sync types):\n- Reads OpenAPI spec from running backend (/v3/api-docs)\n- Regenerates TypeScript types in api-client from live API\n- Auto-bumps patch version in api-client package.json","tree":{"sha":"5375f4093824fb5cfd9d988eb66b6f2cec1d24e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/trees/5375f4093824fb5cfd9d988eb66b6f2cec1d24e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/git/commits/e33c0831c9a3c2220805c3ab9478164ae3e111b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/e33c0831c9a3c2220805c3ab9478164ae3e111b7","node_id":"C_kwDOSDgQ39oAKGUzM2MwODMxYzlhM2MyMjIwODA1YzNhYjk0NzgxNjRhZTNlMTExYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commit/8d4c64a482e2931709e70c16f88b6017652eb16d","sha":"8d4c64a482e2931709e70c16f88b6017652eb16d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/8d4c64a482e2931709e70c16f88b6017652eb16d"}],"sha":"e33c0831c9a3c2220805c3ab9478164ae3e111b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/e33c0831c9a3c2220805c3ab9478164ae3e111b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29812288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeandbonicel","id":29812288,"login":"jeandbonicel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODEyMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeandbonicel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeandbonicel/apps-generator/commits/8d4c64a482e2931709e70c16f88b6017652eb16d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T15:41:51Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T15:41:51Z","email":"bonicel.ftl@gmail.com","name":"JD"},"message":"fix: remove hardcoded values from templates for generic tenant apps\n\nArchitecture audit and fixes to ensure all templates work for any\ntenant application, not just the demo project:\n\n- Parameterize vite proxy target with gatewayPort (was hardcoded 8080)\n- Add devPort/gatewayPort params to shell and frontend_app schemas\n- Dockerfiles respect packageManager param (was hardcoded npm)\n- Shell nginx proxies /api to gateway via GATEWAY_URL env var\n- docker_compose.py reads OIDC issuer from project configs (not hardcoded)\n- docker_compose.py uses env var substitution for postgres credentials\n- Gateway CORS reads allowed origins from Spring config property\n- Gateway SecurityConfig.java conditional on features.oauth2\n- Backend HealthController removes /api prefix (gateway handles it)\n- Shell Dockerfile uses nginx template for envsubst at startup\n- Playwright config uses devPort template variable","tree":{"sha":"3f12d8800d610c0efb72b5467cfac30304c42a0d"