/integration-hub/commit/f4bc13717a52490381b0f53301b61a244fa2878a","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKGY0YmMxMzcxN2E1MjQ5MDM4MWIwZjUzMzAxYjYxYTI0NGZhMjg3OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/6fb6fd4ced123a301f0f0d8909246eefa7520d1a","sha":"6fb6fd4ced123a301f0f0d8909246eefa7520d1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/6fb6fd4ced123a301f0f0d8909246eefa7520d1a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/bf18f509eff3ac642162101ecb1211e9932ee176","sha":"bf18f509eff3ac642162101ecb1211e9932ee176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/bf18f509eff3ac642162101ecb1211e9932ee176"}],"sha":"f4bc13717a52490381b0f53301b61a244fa2878a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/f4bc13717a52490381b0f53301b61a244fa2878a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/bf18f509eff3ac642162101ecb1211e9932ee176/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:24:13Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:24:13Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"chore(ci): las acciones pasan a Node 24 (checkout v7, setup-node v7, setup-java v5, login v4)\n\nEl runner venia avisando: \"Node.js 20 is deprecated... forced to run on Node.js 24\".\nForzar funciona hoy y dejara de funcionar.\n\nPOR QUE v7 Y NO v5. El aviso se arregla igual con v5, pero checkout y setup-node ya\nvan por v7: subir a v5 seria repetir esta faena dos veces mas. Consultado el remoto,\nno de memoria:\n\n  actions/checkout      v1..v7   -> v7\n  actions/setup-node    v1..v7   -> v7\n  actions/setup-java    v1..v5   -> v5\n  docker/login-action   v1..v4   -> v4   (no existe v5)\n  amazon-ecr-login      v1..v2   -> se queda; no hay major mas nueva\n\nQUE ROMPE CADA SALTO, Y POR QUE AQUI NO:\n\n  - checkout v7 bloquea el checkout de PRs de fork en `pull_request_target` y\n    `workflow_run`. Comprobados los siete workflows: ninguno usa esos disparadores.\n  - setup-node v5 cachea solo con un campo `packageManager` en package.json.\n    No lo tenemos, y los pasos que quieren cache ya la piden explicita con\n    `cache-dependency-path: frontend/package-lock.json`.\n  - setup-node v7 quita el export ficticio de NODE_AUTH_TOKEN y migra a ESM.\n    Ni NODE_AUTH_TOKEN ni `registry-url` aparecen en ningun workflow.\n  - setup-java v5 deja de instalar prereleases de JetBrains por defecto. Usamos temurin.\n  - login-action v4 migra a ESM.\n\nTodas exigen runner >= v2.327.1, que es lo que corre ubuntu-latest.\n\nSon 20 lineas y ninguna cambia nada mas que el numero de version.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c0c899291cd8904cfc0ce7d05a937ee2d2e44cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/4c0c899291cd8904cfc0ce7d05a937ee2d2e44cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/bf18f509eff3ac642162101ecb1211e9932ee176","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/bf18f509eff3ac642162101ecb1211e9932ee176","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKGJmMThmNTA5ZWZmM2FjNjQyMTYyMTAxZWNiMTIxMWU5OTMyZWUxNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/6fb6fd4ced123a301f0f0d8909246eefa7520d1a","sha":"6fb6fd4ced123a301f0f0d8909246eefa7520d1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/6fb6fd4ced123a301f0f0d8909246eefa7520d1a"}],"sha":"bf18f509eff3ac642162101ecb1211e9932ee176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/bf18f509eff3ac642162101ecb1211e9932ee176"