b6fd4ced123a301f0f0d8909246eefa7520d1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/6fb6fd4ced123a301f0f0d8909246eefa7520d1a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/98e0a21c0aab81eaa36ba00f6aa1fd32f7a4eade/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T10:02:57Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T10:02:57Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"feat(ci): gate que exige que a main solo entren develop y hotfix/*\n\nCONTRIBUTING.md ya lo declara en su tabla de ramas -\"main: solo merges desde\ndevelop o hotfix/*\"- y hasta hoy no lo comprobaba nadie. Las ultimas ocho\nfusiones directas sobre main cumplen la regla por disciplina, no porque algo lo\nimpida; antes de la migracion a la organizacion, ramas de feature entraban\ndirectas (#59 a #64).\n\nEs el mismo patron que el clasificador de rollback: una regla escrita que se\nconvierte en comprobacion.\n\nPOR QUE IMPORTA. main es lo que se taggea, y de un tag salen las imagenes que\nacaban en la VM (publish-vm-images.yml dispara con `push: tags: v*`). Una rama de\ntrabajo fusionada directa a main se salta la validacion completa que solo corre\nsobre develop, y aterriza en lo desplegable.\n\nPOR QUE UN CHECK Y NO UNA REGLA DE RAMA. Ni los rulesets ni la proteccion clasica\nsaben restringir DE QUE rama viene un pull request: controlan quien empuja y que\nchecks pasan, no el origen. La via es un check requerido, como los otros tres\ngates del repositorio.\n\nQUEDA POR HACER, y sin ello el gate no obliga: anadir \"Origen permitido para\nmain\" a los checks requeridos del ruleset de main. Se hace en la interfaz.\n\nOJO CON LOS REVERT. El boton \"Revert\" de GitHub crea ramas `revert-<PR>-<rama>`,\nque este gate rechaza. Es coherente con CONTRIBUTING -un arreglo urgente sobre lo\ndesplegado va por hotfix/- pero conviene saberlo antes de necesitarlo con prisa.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bedc57db496fd3c970af1bc813eee572d63d02d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/bedc57db496fd3c970af1bc813eee572d63d02d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/98e0a21c0aab81eaa36ba00f6aa1fd32f7a4eade","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/98e0a21c0aab81eaa36ba00f6aa1fd32f7a4eade","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDk4ZTBhMjFjMGFhYjgxZWFhMzZiYTAwZjZhYTFmZDMyZjdhNGVhZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/3fef49ddd2a805beac7edf5084d00f85854e57c6","sha":"3fef49ddd2a805beac7edf5084d00f85854e57c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/3fef49ddd2a805beac7edf5084d00f85854e57c6"}],"sha":"98e0a21c0aab81eaa36ba00f6aa1fd32f7a4eade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/98e0a21c0aab81eaa36ba00f6aa1fd32f7a4eade"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39958584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ndavilal88","id":39958584,"login":"ndavilal88","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTU4NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/