web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/01d60315f931f70e445ae2e80cf7d76f76601d0f","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDAxZDYwMzE1ZjkzMWY3MGU0NDVhZTJlODBjZjdkNzZmNzY2MDFkMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/c49ef5b113bf61bb5a08a9eb6c897a3a0cf83946","sha":"c49ef5b113bf61bb5a08a9eb6c897a3a0cf83946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/c49ef5b113bf61bb5a08a9eb6c897a3a0cf83946"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/e76e9e2cc788b9466090fc735737bc53050d9757","sha":"e76e9e2cc788b9466090fc735737bc53050d9757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/e76e9e2cc788b9466090fc735737bc53050d9757"}],"sha":"01d60315f931f70e445ae2e80cf7d76f76601d0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/01d60315f931f70e445ae2e80cf7d76f76601d0f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/e76e9e2cc788b9466090fc735737bc53050d9757/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:25:56Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:25:56Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"docs(adr): crea ops/fase-7-deploy/rollback/ con la convencion de D7\n\nEl ADR-030 dice que ese directorio \"nace\" y lo cita en backticks, pero no\nexistia: check-markdown-paths.mjs lo detecto y dejo el pull request en rojo a\nlos 10 segundos.\n\nLa correccion no es reescribir la frase para esquivar al validador, es crear el\ndirectorio —que es lo que el ADR afirma—. Su README documenta la convencion de\nD7 para que sea descubrible sin leer el ADR entero: cuando hace falta un script\nde bajada, por que no puede vivir en db/migration, y por que el DDL sin el\nDELETE del historial no sirve.\n\nQueda vacio de scripts a proposito: las dos migraciones destructivas del\nhistorial ya estan aplicadas en todos los entornos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd60b381122009c40789496d9ec0d818acb8425e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/bd60b381122009c40789496d9ec0d818acb8425e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/e76e9e2cc788b9466090fc735737bc53050d9757","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/e76e9e2cc788b9466090fc735737bc53050d9757","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKGU3NmU5ZTJjYzc4OGI5NDY2MDkwZmM3MzU3MzdiYzUzMDUwZDk3NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/5f98cd4b279b755412bbbae9734a5b70d024b6ab","sha":"5f98cd4b279b755412bbbae9734a5b70d024b6ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/5f98cd4b279b755412bbbae9734a5b70d024b6ab"}],"sha":"e76e9e2cc788b9466090fc735737bc53050d9757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/e76e9e2cc788b9466090fc735737bc53050d9757"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/5f98cd4b279b755412bbbae9734a5b70d024b6ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:18:57Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:18:57Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"docs(adr): ADR-030 despliegue automatizado a la VM con modelo pull, aprobacion y rollback clasificado\n\nDireccion pide automatizar el despliegue a la nube. ADR-029 ya preveia este\npaso \"cuando R2 y R3 esten en pie\": R2 esta cumplida en lo esencial (integracion\nconsume las imagenes del registro), R3 no, y el clasificador de D4 seria su\nprimera comprobacion mecanica.\n\nEl hecho que gobierna el diseno esta EJECUTADO, no razonado: volver a la imagen\nanterior NO arranca, aunque la migracion fuera aditiva e inofensiva. Flyway 12\nignora las migraciones futuras por defecto, pero FlywayCreator de Quarkus llama\na ignoreMigrationPatterns() de forma incondicional y con los defaults le pasa un\narray vacio, sobrescribiendo ese default. Comprobado contra un Postgres 16\ndesechable en JVM y en nativo (la imagen que corre en integracion): exit=1 con\n\"Detected applied migration not resolved locally\", y arranque limpio en 0,362 s\nal anadir QUARKUS_FLYWAY_IGNORE_FUTURE_MIGRATIONS=true.\n\nDieciseis reglas. Las que mas cambian la operativa:\n\n- D4 clasifica cada pase en A/B/C por el diff de TODOS los directorios de\n  quarkus.flyway.locations, no solo db/migration: el vertical MT101 tiene un\n  DROP COLUMN (V36) sobre una tabla del camino del dinero.\n- D5 hace el rollback de clase B un cambio de tag mas una variable de runtime,\n  sin tocar la base ni perder datos.\n- D12 aplaza el despliegue con trabajo en vuelo (R8 de ADR-029 no se hereda\n  solo), con dos condiciones basadas en leases que ya existen y se curan solas.\n- D13 define \"tag estable\" como el que se probo sano, no el anterior.\n- D16 acota el dano en el camino de mensajes: lo que el consumer viejo no\n  entienda acaba en audit_dead_letter_event, y hoy no hay reinyeccion.\n\nEstado: propuesta. Quedan tres decisiones fuera de lo tecnico: el ambito compute\npara la instantanea, quienes aprueban, y si se hornea la tolerancia de Jackson\nen audit-consumer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14b987f4bc47bff914274b6fc61f58fdc0779446","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/14b987f4bc47bff914274b6fc61f58fdc0779446"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/5f98cd4b279b755412bbbae9734a5b70d024b6ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/5f98cd4b279b755412bbbae9734a5b70d024b6ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDVmOThjZDRiMjc5Yjc1NTQxMmJiYmFlOTczNGE1YjcwZDAyNGI2YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/c49ef5b113bf61bb5a08a9eb6c897a3a0cf83946","sha":"c49ef5b113bf61bb5a08a9eb6c897a3a0cf83946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/c49ef5b113bf61bb5a08a9eb6c897a3a0cf83946"}],"sha":"5f98cd4b279b755412bbbae9734a5b70d024b6ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/5f98cd4b279b755412bbbae9734a5b70d024b6ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39958584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ndavilal88","id":39958584,"login":"ndavilal88","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTU4NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.g