Qttg9k0nV7EWEazC2v5OursImAJ\n9ydaWEwDc8w5MQ3RWObHIU1SogK4GohkAoEqPAhnEwGpTjMamz/64mv73PFRbafM\nWAbrwzi0Akn95rx3Dd4hcO771BBjxfHHDRerlId6GFp4yM6/F3grpgx17iKaUCcc\nyMBkscGQqL6yOgf0C1SSp2oZTIuX+y5RJxxECcpxsg8gQ3ri7OaqEecoe6aYxN9J\nWb4KZ4fwFro0mLOyBTUT\n=QqWh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-20T05:08:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/13da61d88e5ce004659c19f10376e25af735106a","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDEzZGE2MWQ4OGU1Y2UwMDQ2NTljMTlmMTAzNzZlMjVhZjczNTEwNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/0bc561188af15958e3fef43ba68c7526637ea751","sha":"0bc561188af15958e3fef43ba68c7526637ea751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/0bc561188af15958e3fef43ba68c7526637ea751"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/9b064f465f3dc92a22671c4738977de2414f7722","sha":"9b064f465f3dc92a22671c4738977de2414f7722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/9b064f465f3dc92a22671c4738977de2414f7722"}],"sha":"13da61d88e5ce004659c19f10376e25af735106a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/13da61d88e5ce004659c19f10376e25af735106a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/9b064f465f3dc92a22671c4738977de2414f7722/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T04:59:48Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T04:59:48Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"feat(cd): cada fusion en develop que toque codigo se publica y se despliega en integracion\n\nHasta ahora publicar y desplegar eran dos botones. Esto los encadena para develop: se\nconstruye la imagen, se publica en el registro y se despliega en el servidor on-premise sin\nque nadie toque nada. Integracion queda siempre en la cabeza de develop, y ese binario es el\nmismo que despues se promueve a la nube.\n\nHASTA INTEGRACION Y NO MAS. Produccion sigue disparandose a mano, que es lo que decide\nADR-029: con una sola maquina, migraciones de Flyway que corren al arrancar y un rollback que\nno es simetrico, automatizar el ultimo salto quitaria al unico humano que hoy mira antes de\nque el cambio toque el camino del dinero.\n\nEL FILTRO NO ES POR platform-app NI POR audit-consumer, aunque asi se pidio, y el motivo es\nconcreto: un cambio en platform-contract, en platform-spi, en los verticales o en `frontend/`\ntambien cambia el binario —Quinoa compila el SPA DENTRO de platform-app—. Filtrar por esas dos\ncarpetas habria dejado fuera esos casos, y entonces integracion correria una imagen vieja\ncreyendo estar al dia, que es peor que no desplegar. La lista es de rutas inertes: todo lo que\nno sea documentacion dispara.\n\nDos trampas que aparecieron al escribirlo y que no estaban a la vista:\n\nEl `paths-ignore` no puede vivir en publish-vm-images.yml. Ese workflow se dispara tambien con\ntags `v*`, y los filtros de ruta aplican TAMBIEN a los tags: un release cuyo commit solo tocase\ndocumentacion se habria quedado sin publicar, en silencio, justo en el camino de las versiones.\nPor eso el filtrado vive en el workflow que llama, que solo mira ramas. En ci.yml, en cambio,\n`paths-ignore` seria el error contrario —un check que no existe deja colgado a un ruleset que lo\nexija—, y por eso alli se hace con un job condicionado. Misma intencion, mecanismos opuestos,\ncada uno por su contexto.\n\nY el tag se toma de la salida del workflow que lo calcula, no se deriva otra vez: `github.sha`\nes el SHA completo y las imagenes se publican con el corto. Recalcularlo habria hecho que el\ndespliegue buscase un tag inexistente, y el fallo habria parecido un problema del registro.\n\nNo duplica logica: llama a los dos workflows que ya existen, asi que un cambio en como se\npublica o en como se despliega se hereda solo.\n\nConsecuencia de coste que conviene tener presente: cada fusion con codigo pasa a gastar ~12 min\ndel runner grande, que se factura por minuto. Las fusiones de solo documentacion no disparan\nnada.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1b75ae7a7680a21ebda8619ab9b2258254cbd8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/a1b75ae7a7680a21ebda8619ab9b2258254cbd8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/9b064f465f3dc92a22671c4738977de2414f7722","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/9b064f465f3dc92a22671c4738977de2414f7722","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDliMDY0ZjQ2NWYzZGM5MmEyMjY3MWM0NzM4OTc3ZGUyNDE0Zjc3MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/0bc561188af15958e3fef43ba68c7526637ea751","sha":"0bc561188af15958e3fef43ba68c7526637ea751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/0bc561188af15958e3fef43ba68c7526637ea751"}],"sha":"9b064f465f3dc92a22671c4738977de2414f7722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/9b064f465f3dc92a22671c4738977de2414f7722"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39958584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ndavilal88","id":39958584,"login":"ndavilal88","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTU4NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/795e92fe7dcba64c9b95834927f547a80b0eb90b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T00:16:22Z","email":"39958584+ndavilal88@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ndavilal88"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T00:16:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #95 from BuildSoft-Develoment/develop\n\nSincronizar main: despliegue a integracion y arreglo del filtro de rutas","tree":{"sha":"37da4c04bc8d2bbfd185fe0a6b6cca9585dd7e15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/gi