dSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/3deb4d12bee1615c024ac791299b5abf485ce361"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/e4235b291a7e98574c7ea5b7abb95c770c87ec9f","sha":"e4235b291a7e98574c7ea5b7abb95c770c87ec9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/e4235b291a7e98574c7ea5b7abb95c770c87ec9f"}],"sha":"0bc561188af15958e3fef43ba68c7526637ea751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/0bc561188af15958e3fef43ba68c7526637ea751"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/e4235b291a7e98574c7ea5b7abb95c770c87ec9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T23:20:08Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T23:20:08Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"fix(ci): el filtro de rutas moria con \"no merge base\" y bloqueaba el pull request\n\nAl tercer pull request desde que se introdujo, el job detector fallo con\n`fatal: FETCH_HEAD...HEAD: no merge base` y dejo el PR sin poder integrarse.\n\nLa causa es el `--depth=1` del fetch de la base: trae su punta SIN historia, asi que no hay\nantepasado comun y la comparacion de tres puntos —que necesita uno— no puede resolverse.\nColo en los dos primeros PR por casualidad: la rama salia justo de esa punta, asi que el\nantepasado era ella misma y estaba presente. Al primer PR con la base ya movida, se rompio.\n\nSe quita el `--depth`. No hacia falta: el checkout del propio job usa fetch-depth: 0, asi\nque la historia completa ya esta ahi, y ahora se compara contra `origin/$BASE` directamente.\n\nY se corrige un defecto de diseno peor, que es el que convirtio un calculo fallido en un\npull request bloqueado: si el diff no se puede calcular, ahora el filtro responde\n`pesados=true` y deja que se ejecute todo, en vez de tumbar el job.\n\nUn filtro solo puede permitirse OMITIR cuando esta seguro. Ante cualquier duda tiene que\ncaer del lado de probar de mas, que es barato, y nunca del lado de no probar ni dejar pasar,\nque era exactamente lo que hacia. El fallo por defecto tiene que ser ejecutar — el mismo\nprincipio por el que la lista es de rutas inertes y no de rutas de codigo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37da4c04bc8d2bbfd185fe0a6b6cca9585dd7e15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/37da4c04bc8d2bbfd185fe0a6b6cca9585dd7e15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/e4235b291a7e98574c7ea5b7abb95c770c87ec9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/e4235b291a7e98574c7ea5b7abb95c770c87ec9f","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKGU0MjM1YjI5MWE3ZTk4NTc0YzdlYTViN2FiYjk1Yzc3MGM4N2VjOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/3deb4d12bee1615c024ac791299b5abf485ce361","sha":"3deb4d12bee1615c024ac791299b5abf485ce361","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/3deb4d12bee1615c024ac791299b5abf485ce361"}],"sha":"e4235b291a7e98574c7ea5b7abb95c770c87ec9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/e4235b291a7e98574c7ea5b7abb95c770c87ec9f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39958584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ndavilal88","id":39958584,"login":"ndavilal88","node_id":"