.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/02254625a9656f496249d7659f7672c0da8f7c62","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDAyMjU0NjI1YTk2NTZmNDk2MjQ5ZDc2NTlmNzY3MmMwZGE4ZjdjNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/89f60d7e325270cd1cb2a937f5ef4adec963b453","sha":"89f60d7e325270cd1cb2a937f5ef4adec963b453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/89f60d7e325270cd1cb2a937f5ef4adec963b453"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/2f70e6b86c899125cc9610b4171abd5d1112b139","sha":"2f70e6b86c899125cc9610b4171abd5d1112b139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/2f70e6b86c899125cc9610b4171abd5d1112b139"}],"sha":"02254625a9656f496249d7659f7672c0da8f7c62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/02254625a9656f496249d7659f7672c0da8f7c62"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/2f70e6b86c899125cc9610b4171abd5d1112b139/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:41:58Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:41:58Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"fix(openbao): el verificador acusaba al rol cuando lo unico que pasaba era que nadie habia entrado\n\nTras reinicializar la boveda para activar el desellado automatico, verify-oidc.sh dijo\n\"entraste, pero tu sesion NO recibio ih-secrets-admin\" y mando a revisar el rol en Keycloak\ny el mapper del cliente. Ninguna de las dos cosas estaba mal: sencillamente no se habia\nvuelto a entrar por SSO desde que se borro el volumen, y las entidades viven ahi.\n\nEl mensaje daba por hecho un login previo —\"entraste, pero...\"— y de ahi deducia que el\nclaim no traia el rol. Con esa premisa falsa, las dos causas que ofrecia eran las dos\nequivocadas, y ambas mandan a tocar configuracion que funciona.\n\nAhora enumera las TRES posibilidades y las ordena por probabilidad y por coste de\ndescarte: primero \"nadie ha entrado todavia\", que se comprueba entrando una vez y repitiendo\nel comando; despues el rol; despues el mapper. Y dice explicitamente que las tres producen\nel mismo sintoma, para que nadie deduzca de mas.\n\nEs el mismo error de fondo que ya corregimos hoy en el guardia de pull requests: un\ndiagnostico que afirma mas de lo que puede saber. Un verificador que acusa en falso gasta\nel tiempo de quien lo usa justo cuando menos lo tiene.\n\nSe corrige en las dos copias, la de la VM y la del entorno de integracion, que eran\nidenticas byte a byte. Comprobado ejecutando el bloque en un contenedor Linux para leer el\nmensaje renderizado, no solo `sh -n`: la primera version tenia cuatro comas sueltas fuera\nde las comillas que habrian salido impresas y que la comprobacion de sintaxis no ve.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77fb7c4a1f8c9defead8cc0e5673741ef72979e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/77fb7c4a1f8c9defead8cc0e5673741ef72979e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/2f70e6b86c899125cc9610b4171abd5d1112b139","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/2f70e6b86c899125cc9610b4171abd5d1112b139","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDJmNzBlNmI4NmM4OTkxMjVjYzk2MTBiNDE3MWFiZDVkMTExMmIxMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/89f60d7e325270cd1cb2a937f5ef4adec963b453","sha":"89f60d7e325270cd1cb2a937f5ef4adec963b453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/89f60d7e325270cd1cb2a937f5ef4adec963b453"}],"sha":"2f70e6b86c899125cc9610b4171abd5d1112b139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/2f70e6b86c899125cc9610b4171abd5d1112b139"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39958584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ndavilal88","id":39958584,"login":"ndavilal88","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTU4NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/89f60d7e325270cd1cb2a937f5ef4adec963b453/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T10:43:45Z","email":"39958584+ndavilal88@users.noreply.github.com","