tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/89f60d7e325270cd1cb2a937f5ef4adec963b453","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDg5ZjYwZDdlMzI1MjcwY2QxY2IyYTkzN2Y1ZWY0YWRlYzk2M2I0NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/d010b91b97e5fe56c43ace9e3cd07c06f2451ffa","sha":"d010b91b97e5fe56c43ace9e3cd07c06f2451ffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/d010b91b97e5fe56c43ace9e3cd07c06f2451ffa"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/31abc902d9227e2570f918ca680569876e52df5c","sha":"31abc902d9227e2570f918ca680569876e52df5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/31abc902d9227e2570f918ca680569876e52df5c"}],"sha":"89f60d7e325270cd1cb2a937f5ef4adec963b453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/89f60d7e325270cd1cb2a937f5ef4adec963b453"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/31abc902d9227e2570f918ca680569876e52df5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T10:42:03Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T10:42:03Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"docs(runbook): faltaba montar el motor de secretos, sin el cual la politica no alcanza nada\n\nDesplegando de cero en la VM salio el hueco: recien inicializada, la boveda solo trae\n`cubbyhole`. El motor `secret/` no existe hasta que alguien lo monta, y el runbook nunca lo\ndecia — pasaba directo a crear la politica, que concede lectura sobre `secret/data/...`.\n\nLo peor es CUANDO da la cara. Al desplegar no falla nada: la stack levanta, la app arranca,\nel SSO funciona y la consola de secretos abre. El error aparece mucho despues, al ejecutar\nel primer proceso que resuelve un `${vaultkv:...}`, con un `Missing vaultkv value` que manda\na revisar el token — que estara perfectamente bien.\n\nSe aprovecha para arreglar otras dos cosas que fallaron hoy siguiendo el runbook al pie de\nla letra:\n\n1. `-e BAO_ADDR=http://127.0.0.1:8200` explicito, en los pasos 7 y 8. El contenedor trae\n   BAO_ADDR en https y `docker exec -e VAR` sin valor solo pasa la variable si existe en el\n   shell de quien ejecuta. Sin esto, el CLI habla HTTPS contra un OpenBao que escucha en HTTP\n   plano —el TLS lo termina nginx— y falla con \"http: server gave HTTP response to HTTPS\n   client\", que no sugiere en absoluto cual es el problema. Mordio dos veces seguidas.\n\n2. La politica y el token se crean por linea de comandos, no por la consola web. La creacion\n   de tokens no esta donde uno la busca en la interfaz, y el fichero de la politica ya esta\n   montado dentro del contenedor. De paso, ni el token raiz ni el de la app llegan a\n   mostrarse en pantalla.\n\nY queda escrito que ese token CADUCA a los 32 dias, con el mismo sintoma enganoso.\n\nVerificado con las cuatro comprobaciones de gobernanza que miran rutas en markdown y\nrunbooks: las cuatro en verde.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc4c0a27b5eef52ab229944edd5dfb3abe836684","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/bc4c0a27b5eef52ab229944edd5dfb3abe836684"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/31abc902d9227e2570f918ca680569876e52df5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/31abc902d9227e2570f918ca680569876e52df5c","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDMxYWJjOTAyZDkyMjdlMjU3MGY5MThjYTY4MDU2OTg3NmU1MmRmNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/d010b91b97e5fe56c43ace9e3cd07c06f2451ffa","sha":"d010b91b97e5fe56c43ace9e3cd07c06f2451ffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/d010b91b97e5fe56c43ace9e3cd07c06f2451ffa"}],"sha":"31abc902d9227e2570f918ca680569876e52df5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/31abc902d9227e2570f918ca680569876e52df5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39958584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ndavilal88","id":39958584,"login":"ndavilal88","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTU4NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.co