https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/2e43dfc9cbb179c4ee8739c5fa5a152465513c65"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/a61bf7ee871f020675ffa4e4bfa4924e13bfac39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T09:51:28Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T09:51:28Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"fix(deploy): los scripts del despliegue llegaban sin permiso de ejecucion\n\nAl clonar el repositorio en la VM y lanzar el primero, respondio \"Permission denied\". No\nera de esa maquina: los diez .sh de dist/ estaban guardados en el indice como 100644.\n\nWindows no tiene bit de ejecucion y git, con core.fileMode en false, lo pierde al\nversionar. No se nota al desarrollar —en Windows nadie ejecuta esos scripts— sino en el\nSIGUIENTE clon sobre Linux, que es justo cuando alguien intenta desplegar por primera vez.\nEs el mismo mecanismo que el CRLF: metadatos de Unix que no sobreviven al viaje.\n\nEl sintoma ademas despista: \"Permission denied\" suena a que falta sudo o a que el usuario\nno tiene acceso al directorio, y manda a mirar propietarios y permisos del sistema de\nficheros en vez del modo del propio fichero.\n\nSe arregla para TODO dist/, no solo para el paquete que fallo hoy: los seis de onprem\ntenian el mismo defecto y habrian dado el mismo error a quien los usara.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b25a0d0b89e82fbfc582932e4e5277f2331bf53c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/b25a0d0b89e82fbfc582932e4e5277f2331bf53c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/a61bf7ee871f020675ffa4e4bfa4924e13bfac39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/a61bf7ee871f020675ffa4e4bfa4924e13bfac39","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKGE2MWJmN2VlODcxZjAyMDY3NWZmYTRlNGJmYTQ5MjRlMTNiZmFjMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/bec05b7d1eda7376fcae0d12be03d79a82d096c5","sha":"bec05b7d1eda7376fcae0d12be03d79a82d096c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/bec05b7d1eda7376fcae0d12be03d79a82d096c5"}],"sha":"a61bf7ee871f020675ffa4e4bfa4924e13bfac39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/a61bf7ee871f020675ffa4e4bfa4924e13bfac39"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39958584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ndavilal88","id":39958584,"login":"ndavilal88","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTU4NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/bec05b7d1eda7376fcae0d12be03d79a82d096c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:17:56Z","email":"39958584+ndavilal88@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ndavilal88"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:17:56Z","email"