t.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/aca7dcee7c8e959dda8f9741ced40fed7ac88e01","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKGFjYTdkY2VlN2M4ZTk1OWRkYThmOTc0MWNlZDQwZmVkN2FjODhlMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/ef6191398725cb8c8d5743ebb15daa62fffa244c","sha":"ef6191398725cb8c8d5743ebb15daa62fffa244c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/ef6191398725cb8c8d5743ebb15daa62fffa244c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/71fb317c7e613ff1a1fefbd2423e1a2d0ce8ac71","sha":"71fb317c7e613ff1a1fefbd2423e1a2d0ce8ac71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/71fb317c7e613ff1a1fefbd2423e1a2d0ce8ac71"}],"sha":"aca7dcee7c8e959dda8f9741ced40fed7ac88e01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/aca7dcee7c8e959dda8f9741ced40fed7ac88e01"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/71fb317c7e613ff1a1fefbd2423e1a2d0ce8ac71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T21:19:24Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T21:19:24Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"fix(ci): el guardia acusaba de push directo a una fusion que si venia de un pull request\n\nLa fusion del PR #78 salio en rojo con \"Este commit se empujo DIRECTO a develop\". Era\nfalso: el commit tiene sus dos padres, el committer es GitHub y el mensaje es el que\ngenera la propia interfaz al fusionar. Estructuralmente identico al del PR #77, que paso.\n\nLa causa es que la asociacion commit -> pull request se indexa de forma asincrona, y este\njob arranca segundos despues del merge: la API todavia devolvia una lista vacia. Que el\n#77 pasara no significa que estuviera bien, solo que llego tarde y gano la carrera.\n\nImporta mas de lo que parece. Un guardia que acusa en falso se desactiva a la semana, y\nentonces deja de proteger tambien cuando la acusacion es cierta. Asi que ahora reintenta\nhasta cinco veces con diez segundos de espera, y solo despues de 50 segundos sin\nasociacion concluye que fue un push directo — lo dice en el propio mensaje, para que quien\nlo lea sepa que no es un retraso de indexacion.\n\nAdemas se separa el fallo de la API del veredicto. Antes eran indistinguibles: si la\nllamada moria por permisos, `set -e` cortaba el paso con el error crudo de gh, que no\nmenciona pull requests por ningun lado. Ahora ese caso dice que fallo la API, con el\nmensaje recibido y donde mirar (el bloque permissions, y en una organizacion tambien\nSettings -> Actions -> Workflow permissions, que puede recortar lo que el workflow pide).\n\nProbado en un contenedor Linux con un gh postizo, los cuatro caminos: asociacion inmediata\npasa; asociacion que tarda dos intentos pasa al tercero; lista vacia siempre falla con el\nmensaje de push directo; y error de la API falla diciendo que fue la API.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6128f5694eb57eb38e12287144b941e203142f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/c6128f5694eb57eb38e12287144b941e203142f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/71fb317c7e613ff1a1fefbd2423e1a2d0ce8ac71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/71fb317c7e613ff1a1fefbd2423e1a2d0ce8ac71","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDcxZmIzMTdjN2U2MTNmZjFhMWZlZmJkMjQyM2UxYTJkMGNlOGFjNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/ef6191398725cb8c8d5743ebb15daa62fffa244c","sha":"ef6191398725cb8c8d5743ebb15daa62fffa244c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/ef6191398725cb8c8d5743ebb15daa62fffa244c"}],"sha":"71fb317c7e613ff1a1fefbd2423e1a2d0ce8ac71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/71fb317c7e613ff1a1fefbd2423e1a2d0ce8ac71"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/d7bec085d09e013da9e97c1d3a824f94339ab5f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T20:52:40Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T20:52:40Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"fix(ci): el guardia de RAM rechazaba una maquina que si cumple el requisito\n\nAl ejecutar el paso por primera vez en Linux —no leerlo— salio el fallo: media la RAM en\nGB con division entera, y el kernel nunca ve toda la memoria asignada porque reserva parte\nal arrancar. El WSL2 del equipo, configurado con los 12 GB que exige NATIVE-STATUS.md,\nreporta 11.959 MiB, que redondeado hacia abajo son 11. Con el umbral en 12 GB enteros, esa\nmaquina VALIDA quedaba rechazada por el propio guardia que deberia protegerla.\n\nAhora se mide en MiB con el umbral en 11264. Comprobado en un contenedor Linux con los\ntres casos: 11.959 MiB acepta, 7.000 —el runner estandar de un repo privado— rechaza, y\n15.000 —el runner grande de 16 GB— acepta. Entre el caso valido mas bajo y el invalido mas\nalto hay casi 4 GB de margen, asi que no hace falta afinar mas el numero.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43f8e9136e86d4165deac2342b0e322fa0975ffe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/43f8e9136e86d4165deac2342b0e322fa0975ffe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/d7bec085d09e013da9e97c1d3a824f94339ab5f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/d7bec085d09e013da9e97c1d3a824f94339ab5f4","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKGQ3YmVjMDg1ZDA5ZTAxM2RhOWU5N2MxZDNhODI0Zjk0MzM5YWI1ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/14d39d35276dba1672a406bcb776d35ab86f8304","sha":"14d39d35276dba1672a406bcb776d35ab86f8304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/14d39d35276dba1672a406bcb776d35ab86f8304"}],"sha":"d7bec085d09e013da9e97c1d3a824f94339ab5f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/d7bec085d09e013da9e97c1d3a824f94339ab5f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39958584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndavilal88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id"