/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/8f12ed8d18ce7111400dd418411ced4137ff3666","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDhmMTJlZDhkMThjZTcxMTE0MDBkZDQxODQxMWNlZDQxMzdmZjM2NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/d7741c3780d84b1292742e48c5b32f68f137fbe4","sha":"d7741c3780d84b1292742e48c5b32f68f137fbe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/d7741c3780d84b1292742e48c5b32f68f137fbe4"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/1be8ac41502d8faa3077c604a19cc24b144d21a9","sha":"1be8ac41502d8faa3077c604a19cc24b144d21a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/1be8ac41502d8faa3077c604a19cc24b144d21a9"}],"sha":"8f12ed8d18ce7111400dd418411ced4137ff3666","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/8f12ed8d18ce7111400dd418411ced4137ff3666"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/1be8ac41502d8faa3077c604a19cc24b144d21a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T18:12:58Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T18:12:58Z","email":"ndavilal@buildsoft.com.pe","name":"Natan Angel Davila Lopez"},"message":"chore(ci): el push a develop deja de repetir lo que el pull request acaba de validar\n\nCada fusion disparaba CI dos veces —una por el pull request y otra por el push\nresultante— sobre arboles practicamente identicos. Son ~21 min por ejecucion, asi que\ncada merge costaba ~42 min de runner para obtener el mismo veredicto dos veces. Con los\nminutos de Actions de un repo privado, eso se nota.\n\nLos tres jobs pesados se saltan ahora el push a develop. El guardia NO lleva la\ncondicion: corre solo en push y es el que detecta que alguien empujo directo saltandose\nel pull request. Si tambien se saltara, empujar a develop no dispararia nada en absoluto,\nque es justo el agujero que ese job existe para tapar.\n\nEn main la repeticion se mantiene a proposito. Un pull request valida la mezcla contra la\nbase que habia AL ABRIRLO; si la base se movio entre medias, el commit que aterriza no lo\nha probado nadie —dos PR que pasan por separado pueden romperse al juntarse—. En main eso\nimporta, porque es lo que se taggea y se despliega, y ademas alli las fusiones son pocas.\nEn develop no compensa pagarlo en cada merge.\n\nComprobado evaluando la condicion en los cuatro escenarios: pull request y\nworkflow_dispatch corren los pesados, el push a develop deja solo el guardia, y el push a\nmain sigue corriendo todo. El diff es +18/-0: no se toco ninguna linea existente.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"21271440ac9af79658892788fd05f3afb2f9182a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/trees/21271440ac9af79658892788fd05f3afb2f9182a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/git/commits/1be8ac41502d8faa3077c604a19cc24b144d21a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/1be8ac41502d8faa3077c604a19cc24b144d21a9","node_id":"C_kwDOSDlZS9oAKDFiZThhYzQxNTAyZDhmYWEzMDc3YzYwNGExOWNjMjRiMTQ0ZDIxYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commit/d7741c3780d84b1292742e48c5b32f68f137fbe4","sha":"d7741c3780d84b1292742e48c5b32f68f137fbe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuildSoft-Develoment/integration-hub/commits/d7741c3780d84b1292742e48c5b32f68f137fbe4"}],"sha":"1be8ac41502d8faa3077c604a19cc24b144d21a9","url":"https://